(4045827, 575211, 37334, '<td valign="top">I adore this. To me this is perfect...It makes me want to throw away my camera, because this is the sort of image I so wanted to take when I first took up photography, but never have.<br/> <br/>That sky is so dramatic and sweeps down to meet the horizon right at the vanishing point, drawing the eye through and into the image.<br/> <br/>There is a wonderful balance between the sky and land. And the dodging on the grasses gives a wonderful sense of movement.<br/> <br/>The person in the image, allows us to see ourselves in the image and gives us a sense of peace and awe.10</td>', 'I adore this. To me this is perfect...It makes me want to throw away my camera, because this is the sort of image I so wanted to take when I first took up photography, but never have. That sky is so dramatic and sweeps down to meet the horizon right at the vanishing point, drawing the eye through and into the image. There is a wonderful balance between the sky and land. And the dodging on the grasses gives a wonderful sense of movement. The person in the image, allows us to see ourselves in the image and gives us a sense of peace and awe.10', '2007-09-01 04:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
