(4046359, 579181, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great flood effect. IT really works. I''m not a fan of aerial shots but this is well done.</td>', 'Great flood effect. IT really works. I''m not a fan of aerial shots but this is well done.', '2007-09-01 10:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
