(4046990, 576563, 68947, '<td valign="top">Awwww........poor Fred.  His mommy made him stay home because he wouldn''t eat his dinner.  All of Fred''s friends were going to the Goose Fair and all Fred could do was stand and watch.  "Please, Mom...let me go!"  "No!" his mother said, raising her wing and pointing to the unfinished plate.  "You did not eat your dinner."  So, poor Fred watched as all of his friends flew overhead, going to the fair.  <br/> <br/>Fred learned his lesson that day.  From that day on, Fred always ate his dinner so that he''d not be left behind.  <br/> <br/>Today, Fred owns a chain of goose restaurants where all of the very finest of geese go to eat and Fred never misses a Goose Fair!<br/> <br/>The End.<br/> <br/>I love this shot!  It emotes something from me....mainly, wanting to pick poor Fred up and hug him!  Really a great shot!  It''s so heartwarming.  Perfect title too.</td>', 'Awwww........poor Fred.  His mommy made him stay home because he wouldn''t eat his dinner.  All of Fred''s friends were going to the Goose Fair and all Fred could do was stand and watch.  "Please, Mom...let me go!"  "No!" his mother said, raising her wing and pointing to the unfinished plate.  "You did not eat your dinner."  So, poor Fred watched as all of his friends flew overhead, going to the fair.   Fred learned his lesson that day.  From that day on, Fred always ate his dinner so that he''d not be left behind.   Today, Fred owns a chain of goose restaurants where all of the very finest of geese go to eat and Fred never misses a Goose Fair! The End. I love this shot!  It emotes something from me....mainly, wanting to pick poor Fred up and hug him!  Really a great shot!  It''s so heartwarming.  Perfect title too.', '2007-09-01 13:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
