(4048169, 579842, 45475, '<td valign="top">Flawless. Took me a few seconds to realise what I was looking at. My first thought was "so what, a few people on the sand". Very cool composite. The only thing that makes me wonder, is your choice of wide matting. Even if you had made the bottom same size as top?? Aesthetically, not sure it''s helping you much here and it becomes a major distraction - for me anyways. Still like the image a lot though.</td>', 'Flawless. Took me a few seconds to realise what I was looking at. My first thought was "so what, a few people on the sand". Very cool composite. The only thing that makes me wonder, is your choice of wide matting. Even if you had made the bottom same size as top?? Aesthetically, not sure it''s helping you much here and it becomes a major distraction - for me anyways. Still like the image a lot though.', '2007-09-01 21:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
