(4048703, 579663, 29269, '<td valign="top">REminds me of that Barney song... if all the raindrops were lemondrops and gumdrops... oh what the world it would be!<br/> <br/>Good detail on the face, too. A little off hue (sky turned pinkish in the lower part) but not too distracting. The gumdrops - especially the ones that overlap with the umbrella - do not appear too real, which IS distracting.<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'REminds me of that Barney song... if all the raindrops were lemondrops and gumdrops... oh what the world it would be! Good detail on the face, too. A little off hue (sky turned pinkish in the lower part) but not too distracting. The gumdrops - especially the ones that overlap with the umbrella - do not appear too real, which IS distracting. Good luck!', '2007-09-02 00:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4048707, 579419, 29269, '<td valign="top">A little bit too cartoonish - don''t think that I hate expert editing, I have an image in the race, too - I just thought that this might have been even better with e.g. more noise. This way is too clean.</td>', 'A little bit too cartoonish - don''t think that I hate expert editing, I have an image in the race, too - I just thought that this might have been even better with e.g. more noise. This way is too clean.', '2007-09-02 00:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
