(4048710, 579753, 37930, '<td valign="top">Nice use of expert editing, but it doesn''t quite convince. Not because of the content, that part I really like, but some of the black edges look out of place and the focus looks all over the place... Things are blurred where they shouldn''t be, sharp where they shouldn''t be. It''s cool, but expert editing or no expert editing it should still look like a photograph.</td>', 'Nice use of expert editing, but it doesn''t quite convince. Not because of the content, that part I really like, but some of the black edges look out of place and the focus looks all over the place... Things are blurred where they shouldn''t be, sharp where they shouldn''t be. It''s cool, but expert editing or no expert editing it should still look like a photograph.', '2007-09-02 00:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
