(4048720, 579730, 37930, '<td valign="top">The center presentation works for this, and I like the color theme. Slight noise that doesn''t look quite right in this kind of photo (I''m not a noise hater, but these photos generally look better without it). But overall, very nice.</td>', 'The center presentation works for this, and I like the color theme. Slight noise that doesn''t look quite right in this kind of photo (I''m not a noise hater, but these photos generally look better without it). But overall, very nice.', '2007-09-02 00:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
