(4049720, 568728, 52972, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful, love the greens and sky.</td>', 'Really beautiful, love the greens and sky.', '2007-09-02 09:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049721, 576400, 52972, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a close up!</td>', 'Wow!  What a close up!', '2007-09-02 09:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049727, 576086, 41675, '<td valign="top">My eyes are continually drawn to the white blown out area of the sky. I like the middle section where the light is hitting the valley. I am curious as to what this looks like in color.</td>', 'My eyes are continually drawn to the white blown out area of the sky. I like the middle section where the light is hitting the valley. I am curious as to what this looks like in color.', '2007-09-02 09:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049728, 568248, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your post processing - very nice. Plus, I''m a Taurus so I have to give you a ten. :-D</td>', 'I like your post processing - very nice. Plus, I''m a Taurus so I have to give you a ten. :-D', '2007-09-02 09:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049729, 570985, 41675, '<td valign="top">The celestial sky seems a bit flat compared to the wonderful image of the moon. Its nice though.</td>', 'The celestial sky seems a bit flat compared to the wonderful image of the moon. Its nice though.', '2007-09-02 09:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049730, 577882, 41675, '<td valign="top">I do wonder what the color version of your photo looks like. I do like the shape the water makes against the foreground - nice contrast there.</td>', 'I do wonder what the color version of your photo looks like. I do like the shape the water makes against the foreground - nice contrast there.', '2007-09-02 10:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049731, 578714, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like looking at the foreground. Good depth that leads my eye into the back of your image.</td>', 'I like looking at the foreground. Good depth that leads my eye into the back of your image.', '2007-09-02 10:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049733, 573867, 41675, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty. I like the softness of the colors and the detail of the foreground.</td>', 'Looks pretty. I like the softness of the colors and the detail of the foreground.', '2007-09-02 10:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049734, 578718, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your title made me smile. I like the natural lighting and the boat keeps your image from being boring. It''s a good focal point and I like how the green makes a good contrast against the buildings.</td>', 'Your title made me smile. I like the natural lighting and the boat keeps your image from being boring. It''s a good focal point and I like how the green makes a good contrast against the buildings.', '2007-09-02 10:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049740, 578946, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very pretty still life. I like how the ribbon flows at the bottom.</td>', 'Very pretty still life. I like how the ribbon flows at the bottom.', '2007-09-02 10:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049742, 579707, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice rural landscape. I really like the lighting. Good composition.</td>', 'Nice rural landscape. I really like the lighting. Good composition.', '2007-09-02 10:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049743, 579203, 41675, '<td valign="top">A little too much post processing for my personal tastes, but its a nice portrait. I like the weathered lines on the subjects face and the eyes.</td>', 'A little too much post processing for my personal tastes, but its a nice portrait. I like the weathered lines on the subjects face and the eyes.', '2007-09-02 10:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049745, 579344, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow, cool shot - kind of gross from the insect''s point of view, but really interesting to look at. Nice to see a different type of bird too. Well done.</td>', 'Wow, cool shot - kind of gross from the insect''s point of view, but really interesting to look at. Nice to see a different type of bird too. Well done.', '2007-09-02 10:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049749, 579657, 41675, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh! How absolutely adorable! What a sweet little face! Great capture. Good luck in the challenge - you definitely get the cute factor with this photo.</td>', 'Oh my gosh! How absolutely adorable! What a sweet little face! Great capture. Good luck in the challenge - you definitely get the cute factor with this photo.', '2007-09-02 10:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049751, 578544, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your title reminds me of a song I''ve been hearing on the Christian radio station I listen to. You have a powerful image. I like the light and composition. Very nice.</td>', 'Your title reminds me of a song I''ve been hearing on the Christian radio station I listen to. You have a powerful image. I like the light and composition. Very nice.', '2007-09-02 10:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049779, 574793, 27524, '<td valign="top">Great photo...lovely colors and composition.</td>', 'Great photo...lovely colors and composition.', '2007-09-02 10:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049832, 579666, 43463, '<td valign="top">What a cute little treasure this photo is! Love the set-up with the little boy in a bowler hat popping out of the chest. The old-style clothes and color tones give this photo a sense of nostalgia and times long gone - a ''timeless'' moment of youth forever captured on ''film''. This is a good shot but I do have a few suggestions to make this pop visually even more. The contrast seems a little flat - deepen the shadows and highlights and this image will really pop off the page. I wonder if a square crop might be better than the rectagular one only because it will keep the center of focus on your main subject more strongly. Less background more of your subject for the eye to stay focused on.</td>', 'What a cute little treasure this photo is! Love the set-up with the little boy in a bowler hat popping out of the chest. The old-style clothes and color tones give this photo a sense of nostalgia and times long gone - a ''timeless'' moment of youth forever captured on ''film''. This is a good shot but I do have a few suggestions to make this pop visually even more. The contrast seems a little flat - deepen the shadows and highlights and this image will really pop off the page. I wonder if a square crop might be better than the rectagular one only because it will keep the center of focus on your main subject more strongly. Less background more of your subject for the eye to stay focused on.', '2007-09-02 11:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049925, 575855, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow play. I like the wide angle too,</td>', 'Nice shadow play. I like the wide angle too,', '2007-09-02 11:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049927, 578616, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful spot.</td>', 'Beautiful spot.', '2007-09-02 11:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049929, 564832, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very sharp. Interesting subject.</td>', 'Very sharp. Interesting subject.', '2007-09-02 11:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049937, 573846, 30791, '<td valign="top">awesome!!!!!!!! great colors! and overall exposure<br/>well done! 9</td>', 'awesome!!!!!!!! great colors! and overall exposurewell done! 9', '2007-09-02 11:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4049997, 579860, 44860, '<td valign="top">Light horses, heavy border ...6</td>', 'Light horses, heavy border ...6', '2007-09-02 12:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050053, 579809, 68599, '<td valign="top">Digital Art eh? I really like it.</td>', 'Digital Art eh? I really like it.', '2007-09-02 12:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050086, 579503, 80691, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2007-09-02 12:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050105, 579584, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Nice surreal feel to this which the grain adds to - I like it a lot.Would make a nice print - Not too sure  a lot of DPC''rs will feel the same though.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Nice surreal feel to this which the grain adds to - I like it a lot.Would make a nice print - Not too sure  a lot of DPC''rs will feel the same though.', '2007-09-02 13:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050108, 579606, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Is it the white cliffs of Dover? Nice crisp image with a pleasing composition - Just wish there was some sort of foreground interest to catch our eye a little more.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Is it the white cliffs of Dover? Nice crisp image with a pleasing composition - Just wish there was some sort of foreground interest to catch our eye a little more.', '2007-09-02 13:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050111, 577948, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Love the background colour and great sharpness where needed. Just feel she looks  a little pained in her expression which is a little awkward to look at as a viewer.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Love the background colour and great sharpness where needed. Just feel she looks  a little pained in her expression which is a little awkward to look at as a viewer.', '2007-09-02 13:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050112, 575154, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Like the POV - Just feel it''s a little too unsharp to tell what''s going on.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Like the POV - Just feel it''s a little too unsharp to tell what''s going on.', '2007-09-02 13:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050115, 578762, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Nice leading road into the subject - Wish it was a little more of an exciting location though with some added interest - The moon almost looks fake</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Nice leading road into the subject - Wish it was a little more of an exciting location though with some added interest - The moon almost looks fake', '2007-09-02 13:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050118, 579875, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Nice pose from your subject too but the PP is way over cooked as you can see a white outline over the whole subject that looks far too unnatural.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Nice pose from your subject too but the PP is way over cooked as you can see a white outline over the whole subject that looks far too unnatural.', '2007-09-02 13:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050122, 579661, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Nice POV - The subject matter feels a little confusing as you can''t tell what''s really going on? Is he a dealer? I think it''s the composition that lets this down.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Nice POV - The subject matter feels a little confusing as you can''t tell what''s really going on? Is he a dealer? I think it''s the composition that lets this down.', '2007-09-02 13:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050124, 579714, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Looks almost like an old photograph from the western days - Very nice - Good composition and POV. Well done. My only gripe I would have burned in the mountains to the right a little more as they are the brightest thing here and take our eye out of the frame.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Looks almost like an old photograph from the western days - Very nice - Good composition and POV. Well done. My only gripe I would have burned in the mountains to the right a little more as they are the brightest thing here and take our eye out of the frame.', '2007-09-02 13:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050147, 578926, 30791, '<td valign="top">i love how the clouds are just creeping along the mountians. great capture</td>', 'i love how the clouds are just creeping along the mountians. great capture', '2007-09-02 13:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050150, 577937, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Great lighting on his hair and a nice simple expression.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Great lighting on his hair and a nice simple expression.', '2007-09-02 13:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050152, 578327, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - wish we could see a little more of his face and surroundings to tell us more about the picture.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - wish we could see a little more of his face and surroundings to tell us more about the picture.', '2007-09-02 13:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050171, 579514, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Wonderful lighting too. Just wish there was a zooming car going by or something just to add a little more interest. The picture seems very heavy on the left side and light on the right where a vehicle could balance this out.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Wonderful lighting too. Just wish there was a zooming car going by or something just to add a little more interest. The picture seems very heavy on the left side and light on the right where a vehicle could balance this out.', '2007-09-02 13:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050173, 576932, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Nice deep saturation and good sharpness on the main subject - Pleasing composition too.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Nice deep saturation and good sharpness on the main subject - Pleasing composition too.', '2007-09-02 13:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050175, 572507, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Great sharpness on the eyes and a nice relaxed pose - I would have darkened the chimp to his right down a lot more though as his eye is very distracting from the main subject.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Great sharpness on the eyes and a nice relaxed pose - I would have darkened the chimp to his right down a lot more though as his eye is very distracting from the main subject.', '2007-09-02 13:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050177, 579927, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - Wonderful lighting and nice PP - Wish there was some sort of foreground interest though to add some depth - Still a great shot to be proud of.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - Wonderful lighting and nice PP - Wish there was some sort of foreground interest though to add some depth - Still a great shot to be proud of.', '2007-09-02 13:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050180, 578716, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - Like the tones - The pic feels a little off balance though with both main subjects at each end of the frame - I understand that these type of shots are hard to get so well done on the technicals.</td>', 'Nice shot - Like the tones - The pic feels a little off balance though with both main subjects at each end of the frame - I understand that these type of shots are hard to get so well done on the technicals.', '2007-09-02 13:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050188, 578971, 68956, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, the thing that frightens me about Expert Editing is the worry ''is this real''. I really hope yours is real :)</td>', 'This is beautiful, the thing that frightens me about Expert Editing is the worry ''is this real''. I really hope yours is real :)', '2007-09-02 13:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050190, 578909, 68956, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture of a very special event, well done:)</td>', 'Excellent picture of a very special event, well done:)', '2007-09-02 13:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050193, 577595, 49804, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot, love the colors, and a very great job with the landscape, 10 from me and a fav.</td>', 'Incredible shot, love the colors, and a very great job with the landscape, 10 from me and a fav.', '2007-09-02 13:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050194, 578577, 49804, '<td valign="top">10-Great job here, really nice shot, very smooth and just an incredible shot, and a favorite</td>', '10-Great job here, really nice shot, very smooth and just an incredible shot, and a favorite', '2007-09-02 13:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
