(4050690, 573846, 35274, '<td valign="top">There''s so much to look at! I love the bright pinks and the yellows you chose to use. And your model of course, who is just the right amount of quirky for this shot. I also love how you managed to achieve the feel of movement in the lemons. I sort of wish you hadn''t cropped the umbrella, but it doesn''t matter much to me.</td>', 'There''s so much to look at! I love the bright pinks and the yellows you chose to use. And your model of course, who is just the right amount of quirky for this shot. I also love how you managed to achieve the feel of movement in the lemons. I sort of wish you hadn''t cropped the umbrella, but it doesn''t matter much to me.', '2007-09-02 17:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050713, 579215, 18367, '<td valign="top">I sure hope for your sake that the majority of voters have calibrated monitors.  It would be a shame to see your score suffer because they may have missed the presence of the cats.  I love the misty look to this image... well done.</td>', 'I sure hope for your sake that the majority of voters have calibrated monitors.  It would be a shame to see your score suffer because they may have missed the presence of the cats.  I love the misty look to this image... well done.', '2007-09-02 17:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050726, 568248, 35274, '<td valign="top">This image is like velvet. Chocolate velvet (if that makes any sense). I just love the processing and the color pallet. I think it really makes this image stand out. Also: spot on focus and I really love those ferns there for some reason.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-08 01:12:41.</i></td>', 'This image is like velvet. Chocolate velvet (if that makes any sense). I just love the processing and the color pallet. I think it really makes this image stand out. Also: spot on focus and I really love those ferns there for some reason.', '2007-09-02 17:27:34.000000', '2007-09-08 02:12:41.000000', 1),
(4050783, 577937, 35274, '<td valign="top">The hair seems just a little over sharpened but it certainly doesn''t detract from those very attention grabbing eyes. Great tonal range and focusing also.</td>', 'The hair seems just a little over sharpened but it certainly doesn''t detract from those very attention grabbing eyes. Great tonal range and focusing also.', '2007-09-02 17:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050787, 572304, 35274, '<td valign="top">What a great subject. And I do believe it is the sky and the center composition that really make this image pop. I''ll assume you used some form of HDR to achieve the tonal range you have, and you did a wonderful job. Kudos.</td>', 'What a great subject. And I do believe it is the sky and the center composition that really make this image pop. I''ll assume you used some form of HDR to achieve the tonal range you have, and you did a wonderful job. Kudos.', '2007-09-02 17:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050797, 576178, 35274, '<td valign="top">Could this perhaps be the work of arsenal? Hmm?<br/>Well I think this is just OOZING with creativity. And oozing with masterful editing techniques to boot. Great attention to detail in making the grooves in his face match up so perfectly. Also love the little tribute to ''cowspace'' on the right. Very fitting for some odd reason.</td>', 'Could this perhaps be the work of arsenal? Hmm?Well I think this is just OOZING with creativity. And oozing with masterful editing techniques to boot. Great attention to detail in making the grooves in his face match up so perfectly. Also love the little tribute to ''cowspace'' on the right. Very fitting for some odd reason.', '2007-09-02 18:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050826, 579546, 35274, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a really interesting subject. I think you could have made this image pop a little bit more, perhaps with some more contrast, or maybe turning into a black and white piece.</td>', 'You''ve captured a really interesting subject. I think you could have made this image pop a little bit more, perhaps with some more contrast, or maybe turning into a black and white piece.', '2007-09-02 18:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050832, 576173, 35274, '<td valign="top">I find this image very odd for some reason. I know something must have been photoshopped in. Methinks it is the mountain background, because it doesn''t seem to really fit for some reason. Maybe it''s because the other half of the image seems like something that was shot in a studio somehow. Her entire stance seems a little off as well, as if she had been rotated a few degrees to the left. But this is still a very interesting image.</td>', 'I find this image very odd for some reason. I know something must have been photoshopped in. Methinks it is the mountain background, because it doesn''t seem to really fit for some reason. Maybe it''s because the other half of the image seems like something that was shot in a studio somehow. Her entire stance seems a little off as well, as if she had been rotated a few degrees to the left. But this is still a very interesting image.', '2007-09-02 18:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050857, 579937, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the movement in this photo a lot - it appears as is the tree is bending to meet the flight of the birds. I admit I got stumped for a moment on the title, as I initially thought it read "Ebola".</td>', 'I like the movement in this photo a lot - it appears as is the tree is bending to meet the flight of the birds. I admit I got stumped for a moment on the title, as I initially thought it read "Ebola".', '2007-09-02 18:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4050868, 577888, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very strange but interesting. I''m not sure it works for me, but I keep wanting to look at it, so obviously it appeals on the level of wanting to delve deeper into the photo. Certainly creative. You did a good job of keeping some semblance of shadow under the train so it doesn''t look completely unnatural.</td>', 'Very strange but interesting. I''m not sure it works for me, but I keep wanting to look at it, so obviously it appeals on the level of wanting to delve deeper into the photo. Certainly creative. You did a good job of keeping some semblance of shadow under the train so it doesn''t look completely unnatural.', '2007-09-02 18:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
