(4050912, 573675, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice timed exposure with the ship and star trails - the scale may be a tad off, but otherwise very cool. Great idea.</td>', 'Nice timed exposure with the ship and star trails - the scale may be a tad off, but otherwise very cool. Great idea.', '2007-09-02 18:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051011, 568794, 34082, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a nice picture but you should have posted it bigger.</td>', 'Seems to be a nice picture but you should have posted it bigger.', '2007-09-02 20:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051072, 579704, 11078, '<td valign="top">Wow This has to Ribbon<br/>Fantasic image So different</td>', 'Wow This has to RibbonFantasic image So different', '2007-09-02 21:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051081, 578044, 11078, '<td valign="top">Stunning image I love the look of this</td>', 'Stunning image I love the look of this', '2007-09-02 21:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051090, 578926, 11078, '<td valign="top">Wow very nicely done this is lovely</td>', 'Wow very nicely done this is lovely', '2007-09-02 21:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051092, 579012, 11078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image just lovely</td>', 'Beautiful image just lovely', '2007-09-02 21:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051134, 579942, 73564, '<td valign="top">Hey, this is neat, good job, pretty bearded dragon, 8.</td>', 'Hey, this is neat, good job, pretty bearded dragon, 8.', '2007-09-02 21:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051145, 577359, 14476, '<td valign="top">Flamboyant and delightful.  If you had been able to concentrate on the one big flower and its adjacent bud, this would be a spectacular image.  The background and bits of color tend to detract from the overall enjoyment of this nice image.  Beautiful definition on that main attraction.</td>', 'Flamboyant and delightful.  If you had been able to concentrate on the one big flower and its adjacent bud, this would be a spectacular image.  The background and bits of color tend to detract from the overall enjoyment of this nice image.  Beautiful definition on that main attraction.', '2007-09-02 21:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051146, 573105, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot because it gives information about the monk''s surroundings and of course the sun''s rays are a bonus.  But it is a posed shot, and frequently unposed images carry more excitement to the viewer.  Still, congratulations on being in a location where you could explore such beauty and capture some of it.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot because it gives information about the monk''s surroundings and of course the sun''s rays are a bonus.  But it is a posed shot, and frequently unposed images carry more excitement to the viewer.  Still, congratulations on being in a location where you could explore such beauty and capture some of it.', '2007-09-02 21:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051147, 579749, 14476, '<td valign="top">This looks like Iceland. I wonder if it is.  In any event, it''s nice to see all that water coming out of the hillside.  If it was mine I might concentrate on some of the interesting water flows and forget the sky which isn''t all that exciting.</td>', 'This looks like Iceland. I wonder if it is.  In any event, it''s nice to see all that water coming out of the hillside.  If it was mine I might concentrate on some of the interesting water flows and forget the sky which isn''t all that exciting.', '2007-09-02 21:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051149, 579545, 14476, '<td valign="top">I know you wanted to show the person and the dog, but it would have been super if you had been able to capture the person''s feet...</td>', 'I know you wanted to show the person and the dog, but it would have been super if you had been able to capture the person''s feet...', '2007-09-02 21:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051151, 568544, 14476, '<td valign="top">And a great tribute it is!</td>', 'And a great tribute it is!', '2007-09-02 21:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051153, 577977, 14476, '<td valign="top">Awww, this is great.  It took an unconventional mind to think of this one, and I want to know who did it when this is all over...<br/>:-))</td>', 'Awww, this is great.  It took an unconventional mind to think of this one, and I want to know who did it when this is all over...:-))', '2007-09-02 21:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051154, 579653, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene with nice progression from foreground to the mountain.  Colors need to be punched up to create interest and keep the viewer in the picture.<br/>Good seeing.</td>', 'Lovely scene with nice progression from foreground to the mountain.  Colors need to be punched up to create interest and keep the viewer in the picture.Good seeing.', '2007-09-02 21:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051157, 579250, 14476, '<td valign="top">Delightful pastoral scene.  Nice treatment - Very nice treatment.<br/> <br/>(so, I''m wondering why the boat is empty and apparently not tethered. but that''s part of the fun of this very nice image)</td>', 'Delightful pastoral scene.  Nice treatment - Very nice treatment. (so, I''m wondering why the boat is empty and apparently not tethered. but that''s part of the fun of this very nice image)', '2007-09-02 21:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051160, 579722, 14476, '<td valign="top">They are beautiful in their own right, but your enhancement makes this bird stand out - big time!</td>', 'They are beautiful in their own right, but your enhancement makes this bird stand out - big time!', '2007-09-02 21:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051163, 576167, 25095, '<td valign="top">real clever idea and done well, but I think I would have rather seen the "darker" side of the castle be in the reflection.  Under water kind of has that mystical, dark, cold, deathly feel plus...I fricken lost my train of thought, hopefully the brain will kick in and I can come back to edit this.</td>', 'real clever idea and done well, but I think I would have rather seen the "darker" side of the castle be in the reflection.  Under water kind of has that mystical, dark, cold, deathly feel plus...I fricken lost my train of thought, hopefully the brain will kick in and I can come back to edit this.', '2007-09-02 22:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051171, 577949, 83631, '<td valign="top">I can''t stop looking at this . . . the contradiction has me transfixed.</td>', 'I can''t stop looking at this . . . the contradiction has me transfixed.', '2007-09-02 22:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051177, 579860, 25095, '<td valign="top">I would have scored this higher had it been done like a triptych with 3 distinct frames around the horses.  As is, you are trying to present them as three different horses yet your repeating background, blurred space between them (which almost comes off as dust) and uneven fence line show they are merged images, framing them would have hidden this better and maybe made the view belive a little more that it could be 3 different horses.</td>', 'I would have scored this higher had it been done like a triptych with 3 distinct frames around the horses.  As is, you are trying to present them as three different horses yet your repeating background, blurred space between them (which almost comes off as dust) and uneven fence line show they are merged images, framing them would have hidden this better and maybe made the view belive a little more that it could be 3 different horses.', '2007-09-02 22:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051181, 579652, 83631, '<td valign="top">Oh!  Wow!  The intensity of his eyes is amazing.  Love the clarity.</td>', 'Oh!  Wow!  The intensity of his eyes is amazing.  Love the clarity.', '2007-09-02 22:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051191, 579514, 83631, '<td valign="top">Don''t know where this shot was taken, but it makes me think of home . . . it ''feels'' like The South.</td>', 'Don''t know where this shot was taken, but it makes me think of home . . . it ''feels'' like The South.', '2007-09-02 22:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051221, 578915, 74821, '<td valign="top">Looks out of focus and the highlights seem blown out.</td>', 'Looks out of focus and the highlights seem blown out.', '2007-09-02 22:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051225, 578432, 74821, '<td valign="top">What''s that growing out of his head?</td>', 'What''s that growing out of his head?', '2007-09-02 22:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051233, 578946, 74821, '<td valign="top">Nicely done with the flower vase off center and the trail of ribbon to counter balance.</td>', 'Nicely done with the flower vase off center and the trail of ribbon to counter balance.', '2007-09-02 22:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051237, 573899, 74821, '<td valign="top">I look at the food then the chef then the pile of plates.  Holds my interest.</td>', 'I look at the food then the chef then the pile of plates.  Holds my interest.', '2007-09-02 22:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051238, 575977, 25095, '<td valign="top">too funny  I always wondered who that was singing up there in the hills.</td>', 'too funny  I always wondered who that was singing up there in the hills.', '2007-09-02 22:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051273, 577888, 74821, '<td valign="top">Very creative but the image is not that powerful.  It looks dull and over processed to me.</td>', 'Very creative but the image is not that powerful.  It looks dull and over processed to me.', '2007-09-02 23:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051274, 579704, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the composition - sparse but effective, and great sky capture.</td>', 'I like the composition - sparse but effective, and great sky capture.', '2007-09-02 23:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051275, 568544, 74821, '<td valign="top">Great concept, excellent depth.</td>', 'Great concept, excellent depth.', '2007-09-02 23:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051277, 579879, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet softness.  I personally hate those headband things, but I guess they''re still all the rage and it does carry the theme.</td>', 'Sweet softness.  I personally hate those headband things, but I guess they''re still all the rage and it does carry the theme.', '2007-09-02 23:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051279, 579649, 74821, '<td valign="top">Powerful image but I''d like to see more shadow detail</td>', 'Powerful image but I''d like to see more shadow detail', '2007-09-02 23:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051282, 577313, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the composition here.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the composition here.', '2007-09-02 23:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051283, 579934, 74821, '<td valign="top">Cool but what if you cropped it even narrower to remove the disturbing lights on the bottom left.</td>', 'Cool but what if you cropped it even narrower to remove the disturbing lights on the bottom left.', '2007-09-02 23:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051285, 579714, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet this rocks in B&amp;W, too.</td>', 'I''ll bet this rocks in B&W, too.', '2007-09-02 23:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051287, 576563, 74821, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2007-09-02 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051288, 579788, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the light, and a nice setting kitty chose for the portrait!</td>', 'Love the light, and a nice setting kitty chose for the portrait!', '2007-09-02 23:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051289, 578959, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Excellent moment in time capture.</td>', 'Very nice!  Excellent moment in time capture.', '2007-09-02 23:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051290, 579509, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sorry they''re eating everything but they really are very photogenic little guys.  The flower at the top and the gradation of light here make this work, though I still like the other one, too.</td>', 'Sorry they''re eating everything but they really are very photogenic little guys.  The flower at the top and the gradation of light here make this work, though I still like the other one, too.', '2007-09-02 23:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051294, 579906, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent depth, detail, and texture.  I can feel those leaves.</td>', 'Excellent depth, detail, and texture.  I can feel those leaves.', '2007-09-02 23:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051308, 579285, 74821, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you points for expert editing although the head looks a bit fat and unnatural.</td>', 'I''m giving you points for expert editing although the head looks a bit fat and unnatural.', '2007-09-02 23:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051309, 575678, 42495, '<td valign="top">So simple, yet so emotive.  This is one that is hard to look away from - I feel as if they boy is looking right at me.</td>', 'So simple, yet so emotive.  This is one that is hard to look away from - I feel as if they boy is looking right at me.', '2007-09-02 23:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051314, 579631, 74821, '<td valign="top">Oh, if it weren''t for the reflection on the belt buckle.</td>', 'Oh, if it weren''t for the reflection on the belt buckle.', '2007-09-02 23:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051315, 575723, 42495, '<td valign="top">I would have actually believed the real Paris, but the Ballys is a giveaway.  I would have cloned it out and chosen a different title that doesn''t give it away.</td>', 'I would have actually believed the real Paris, but the Ballys is a giveaway.  I would have cloned it out and chosen a different title that doesn''t give it away.', '2007-09-02 23:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051322, 571028, 74821, '<td valign="top">The street light really takes away from this image for me.</td>', 'The street light really takes away from this image for me.', '2007-09-02 23:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051331, 579790, 74821, '<td valign="top">A new way of looking at Jackson Square.  Adding this to my favorites.</td>', 'A new way of looking at Jackson Square.  Adding this to my favorites.', '2007-09-02 23:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051332, 579073, 45475, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I''m a sucker for these extreme close up, super wide angle shots of cows. There''s something so delightful about them, and this one''s made even more-so because of the huge tongue poking out. Well done! The only minor nit-pick is that the burning is visible in the clouds above the nose. Still a 10 in my book though!</td>', 'Back to comment: I''m a sucker for these extreme close up, super wide angle shots of cows. There''s something so delightful about them, and this one''s made even more-so because of the huge tongue poking out. Well done! The only minor nit-pick is that the burning is visible in the clouds above the nose. Still a 10 in my book though!', '2007-09-02 23:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051340, 579714, 73253, '<td valign="top">this is awesome</td>', 'this is awesome', '2007-09-02 23:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051346, 579693, 80588, '<td valign="top">Mid snack makes this even more sweet!</td>', 'Mid snack makes this even more sweet!', '2007-09-02 23:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051347, 579203, 80588, '<td valign="top">I''d like to hear the story behind this! Very moving.</td>', 'I''d like to hear the story behind this! Very moving.', '2007-09-02 23:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051348, 579073, 80588, '<td valign="top">I just LOVE this! What a FUN shot!</td>', 'I just LOVE this! What a FUN shot!', '2007-09-02 23:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051357, 568544, 45475, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: A very tasteful tribute to Penedo. Love that you didn''t try to copy every detail, but instead, made it your own. Great idea, well executed. Faved.</td>', 'Back to comment: A very tasteful tribute to Penedo. Love that you didn''t try to copy every detail, but instead, made it your own. Great idea, well executed. Faved.', '2007-09-02 23:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051403, 579091, 74821, '<td valign="top">Nice creative editing.</td>', 'Nice creative editing.', '2007-09-02 23:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051411, 577948, 74821, '<td valign="top">Two problems for me:  the teeth are blown out and the eye is covered too much or not enough.</td>', 'Two problems for me:  the teeth are blown out and the eye is covered too much or not enough.', '2007-09-02 23:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051415, 578977, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Worthy of a postcard. 7</td>', 'Very pretty. Worthy of a postcard. 7', '2007-09-02 23:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051417, 579833, 15711, '<td valign="top">I actually was thinking of this shot as I took a bath. LOL<br/> <br/>I love the DOF although I''m not sure about the blurred part in the middle foreground.  Those beady little eyes are great. 7</td>', 'I actually was thinking of this shot as I took a bath. LOL I love the DOF although I''m not sure about the blurred part in the middle foreground.  Those beady little eyes are great. 7', '2007-09-02 23:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051422, 579693, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness. The perfect DOF and grassy mouth really work. On 2nd look, bumping up.  This is just tooo good.</td>', 'Oh my goodness. The perfect DOF and grassy mouth really work. On 2nd look, bumping up.  This is just tooo good.', '2007-09-02 23:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051425, 579940, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and very emotive.  Is the horizon slightly tilted??? Probably just the mist.  Lovely indeed.</td>', 'Simple and very emotive.  Is the horizon slightly tilted??? Probably just the mist.  Lovely indeed.', '2007-09-02 23:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051426, 576066, 15711, '<td valign="top">That red lighthouse is killer! Love the orange sky and reflection.</td>', 'That red lighthouse is killer! Love the orange sky and reflection.', '2007-09-02 23:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051429, 566669, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really liked this the minute I saw it.  It has a great story. I love the line of the old boat sending us out to the people in the water. Great sky.  I''m making a 2nd pass and am bumping this up another point. 8</td>', 'I really liked this the minute I saw it.  It has a great story. I love the line of the old boat sending us out to the people in the water. Great sky.  I''m making a 2nd pass and am bumping this up another point. 8', '2007-09-02 23:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051430, 568794, 74821, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the spheres.</td>', 'I don''t get the spheres.', '2007-09-02 23:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051431, 568271, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really like a photorealistic painting!!</td>', 'Really like a photorealistic painting!!', '2007-09-02 23:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051433, 579714, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific wide angle. I like the clouds and sky.  Did you run an acid filter on it?  Interesting . . . .</td>', 'Terrific wide angle. I like the clouds and sky.  Did you run an acid filter on it?  Interesting . . . .', '2007-09-02 23:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051434, 568283, 15711, '<td valign="top">Neat- O!!!!!</td>', 'Neat- O!!!!!', '2007-09-02 23:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051435, 578174, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is abstract and very appealing to me. Would make a great poster. 7</td>', 'This is abstract and very appealing to me. Would make a great poster. 7', '2007-09-02 23:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051436, 577914, 74821, '<td valign="top">Great concept and excellent execution.</td>', 'Great concept and excellent execution.', '2007-09-02 23:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051437, 579488, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific editing!!!!</td>', 'Terrific editing!!!!', '2007-09-02 23:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051439, 579365, 15711, '<td valign="top">How very sweet! Perfect focus and DOF.  It seems a touch pink/magenta to me but no points off. ;~D</td>', 'How very sweet! Perfect focus and DOF.  It seems a touch pink/magenta to me but no points off. ;~D', '2007-09-02 23:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051440, 579722, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Makes me think of a photorealism type painting.</td>', 'I like this.  Makes me think of a photorealism type painting.', '2007-09-02 23:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051441, 579662, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is where a photo turns into digital art. I like it. The sky, the touch of softness, but mostly her eyes. It might be a bit too digitized for the masses, but it''ll get a 7 from me. ;~D  Good luck!</td>', 'This is where a photo turns into digital art. I like it. The sky, the touch of softness, but mostly her eyes. It might be a bit too digitized for the masses, but it''ll get a 7 from me. ;~D  Good luck!', '2007-09-03 00:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051442, 575896, 15711, '<td valign="top">The blue/green combo is fantastic.</td>', 'The blue/green combo is fantastic.', '2007-09-03 00:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051444, 578903, 74821, '<td valign="top">Oh, so close.</td>', 'Oh, so close.', '2007-09-03 00:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051445, 571295, 15711, '<td valign="top">Almost like a pastel painting. I like it.</td>', 'Almost like a pastel painting. I like it.', '2007-09-03 00:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051446, 577834, 15711, '<td valign="top">The complementary green/red of his outfit jumps off of the page.</td>', 'The complementary green/red of his outfit jumps off of the page.', '2007-09-03 00:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051447, 572215, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty wonderful. I''m always amazed that anyone can capture a bolt of lightning.  This one is really goooooood!!!</td>', 'Pretty wonderful. I''m always amazed that anyone can capture a bolt of lightning.  This one is really goooooood!!!', '2007-09-03 00:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051449, 578854, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific.  I like the subtlety of it.  Some might think it needs a bit more color but I think you nailed it.  Perfectly composed.</td>', 'Terrific.  I like the subtlety of it.  Some might think it needs a bit more color but I think you nailed it.  Perfectly composed.', '2007-09-03 00:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051450, 579841, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the minimal feel of the human. Nice. Great colors!!</td>', 'I like the minimal feel of the human. Nice. Great colors!!', '2007-09-03 00:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051452, 579659, 15711, '<td valign="top">HDR? I like the textures and simplicity. Nice array of colors.  If I were to change anything I might make the blue of the sky a touch more vivid, but no points off. 7</td>', 'HDR? I like the textures and simplicity. Nice array of colors.  If I were to change anything I might make the blue of the sky a touch more vivid, but no points off. 7', '2007-09-03 00:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051453, 571423, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. I like the shapes and light/dark combination. 7</td>', 'Wonderful composition. I like the shapes and light/dark combination. 7', '2007-09-03 00:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051455, 579010, 15711, '<td valign="top">The colors pop off of the page.</td>', 'The colors pop off of the page.', '2007-09-03 00:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051456, 575973, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and very emotive. This is a classic.</td>', 'Simple and very emotive. This is a classic.', '2007-09-03 00:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051457, 579418, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great texture. I might''ve played with saturation of color a bit but I do like it. ;~D</td>', 'Great texture. I might''ve played with saturation of color a bit but I do like it. ;~D', '2007-09-03 00:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051458, 578971, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love the simplicity of it. Lighthouses are the best subjects.</td>', 'Beautiful. Love the simplicity of it. Lighthouses are the best subjects.', '2007-09-03 00:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051459, 579927, 15711, '<td valign="top">Powerful. That sky is something else.  GREAT shot.</td>', 'Powerful. That sky is something else.  GREAT shot.', '2007-09-03 00:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051460, 578639, 74821, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2007-09-03 00:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051461, 579957, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and tack sharp. Love the subtle bokeh. It''s the emerald color of it that works so well for my eye. 7</td>', 'Simple and tack sharp. Love the subtle bokeh. It''s the emerald color of it that works so well for my eye. 7', '2007-09-03 00:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051462, 579574, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  Simple and nice tones. 7</td>', 'Beautifully done.  Simple and nice tones. 7', '2007-09-03 00:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051463, 579599, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the sun and the grasses.  Subtle and classic.</td>', 'I like the placement of the sun and the grasses.  Subtle and classic.', '2007-09-03 00:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051465, 570030, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is oddly wonderful.  I think if I were to change a thing, I''d take off the glasses. For some reason they don''t suit the mood for me.</td>', 'This is oddly wonderful.  I think if I were to change a thing, I''d take off the glasses. For some reason they don''t suit the mood for me.', '2007-09-03 00:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
