(4051467, 579550, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice in your face portrait.  Perfect focus and DOF. I like the crop. Usually if you "chop off" a chin, it looks funky, but you pulled it off. Well done.</td>', 'Nice in your face portrait.  Perfect focus and DOF. I like the crop. Usually if you "chop off" a chin, it looks funky, but you pulled it off. Well done.', '2007-09-03 00:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
