(4051877, 579913, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The only comment that is of course only my opinion is, you have reduced your final score by at least half a point because you have reduced the viewing area of the image with this large frame.<br/> <br/>It works, the size is about right, but when you''re limited to 720 pixels your main subject ends up too little to completely enjoy. <br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice. The only comment that is of course only my opinion is, you have reduced your final score by at least half a point because you have reduced the viewing area of the image with this large frame. It works, the size is about right, but when you''re limited to 720 pixels your main subject ends up too little to completely enjoy.  Good luck!', '2007-09-03 02:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
