(4051973, 579073, 73981, '<td valign="top">As disgusting as that tongue looks, I''ve eaten so much here in Japan that I can''t say it isn''t beautiful (Or tasty). Love the contrast. The fur looks like it''s been overly &lt;Insert word for the effect that neatimage or noiseninja does to make things look smooth&gt;. Whether that''s what you did or not, I can''t say. I still like the photo. 8</td>', 'As disgusting as that tongue looks, I''ve eaten so much here in Japan that I can''t say it isn''t beautiful (Or tasty). Love the contrast. The fur looks like it''s been overly <Insert word for the effect that neatimage or noiseninja does to make things look smooth>. Whether that''s what you did or not, I can''t say. I still like the photo. 8', '2007-09-03 02:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4051977, 579714, 73981, '<td valign="top">I love these kinds of images. The colors are a bit dark, not overly saturated...that''s what I like!! However, the shot itself isn''t all that interesting, to me at least. Maybe I''m just not a nature person. I still like the photo though. 6</td>', 'I love these kinds of images. The colors are a bit dark, not overly saturated...that''s what I like!! However, the shot itself isn''t all that interesting, to me at least. Maybe I''m just not a nature person. I still like the photo though. 6', '2007-09-03 02:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
