(4055774, 575969, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don´t want to sound nasty but I don´t really find this shot visually stimulating, looks like one of those hundred images I can find in the "used car for sale" in the newspaper everyday, in other words a snapshot.  Try taking your car to a more interesting location next time and find maybe a more interesting angle and lighting, like take a photo at dusk or dawn next time, like they do in those fancy ad brochures car companies do all the time?</td>', 'Sorry, I don´t want to sound nasty but I don´t really find this shot visually stimulating, looks like one of those hundred images I can find in the "used car for sale" in the newspaper everyday, in other words a snapshot.  Try taking your car to a more interesting location next time and find maybe a more interesting angle and lighting, like take a photo at dusk or dawn next time, like they do in those fancy ad brochures car companies do all the time?', '2007-09-04 07:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
