(4055777, 579842, 27482, '<td valign="top">I don´t know what to tell you, that extravagant frame is not to my taste and neither is that huge shadow in the left part of the photo.  Also the multiplicity doesn´t really tell a story to me, sure it´s clever but it´s so easy to do and when I see it I want a sense of story, to me this is just some people walking and in pretty much the same posture and position in all places.  It´s not bad though and way to go with experimenting, just take it to the next level next time :)</td>', 'I don´t know what to tell you, that extravagant frame is not to my taste and neither is that huge shadow in the left part of the photo.  Also the multiplicity doesn´t really tell a story to me, sure it´s clever but it´s so easy to do and when I see it I want a sense of story, to me this is just some people walking and in pretty much the same posture and position in all places.  It´s not bad though and way to go with experimenting, just take it to the next level next time :)', '2007-09-04 07:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
