(4056676, 579051, 51306, '<td valign="top">Surreal ....  I''ve been to many a balloon lift in Albuquerque.  The use of light here and the vibrancy of the color against the muted browns of the<br/>earth makes this haunting.  Great job!</td>', 'Surreal ....  I''ve been to many a balloon lift in Albuquerque.  The use of light here and the vibrancy of the color against the muted browns of theearth makes this haunting.  Great job!', '2007-09-04 13:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
