(4058534, 579704, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice imagery, though I worry about the foreground character (Moses?) - he comes off a bit 2D, almost Monty Python-esque, which is fine in and of itself except it seems a little out of place with the rest of composition.  Love the clouds, background, building &amp; the ground - you have great things going on there &amp; they all work great for me!  &lt;&lt; 8 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Nice imagery, though I worry about the foreground character (Moses?) - he comes off a bit 2D, almost Monty Python-esque, which is fine in and of itself except it seems a little out of place with the rest of composition.  Love the clouds, background, building & the ground - you have great things going on there & they all work great for me!  << 8 >>', '2007-09-04 23:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4058549, 577123, 67841, '<td valign="top">That''s a unique angle!  You could have cloned out that upper right hand corner, given the Expert ruleset, but I''m not going to penalize you for it...  &lt;&lt; 8 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'That''s a unique angle!  You could have cloned out that upper right hand corner, given the Expert ruleset, but I''m not going to penalize you for it...  << 8 >>', '2007-09-04 23:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
