(4058748, 569983, 76217, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this photo - and versions of it - so many times that it becomes tiresome. I''m not going to vote this image at all because I would just give it a 5. This may be the greatest "butterfly and flower" shot of all time and I wouldn''t know.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure why I picked this shot out of 500 to give this particular comment to. I appreciate your efforts. Try harder. <br/> <br/>At the very least, you''ll have a comment on your picture. We all like getting comments.  Perhaps I''ve given you some insight into my thought processes that are helpful. Perhaps you''ll think I''m just an idiot (and perhaps I am) and ignore my comment.<br/> <br/>But...when you see you have a comment, and you see that its this one, you''ll at least remember it.<br/> <br/>BTW. After some consternation I decided to give you a 6 rather than a non-vote. Thanks for listening :)</td>', 'I''ve seen this photo - and versions of it - so many times that it becomes tiresome. I''m not going to vote this image at all because I would just give it a 5. This may be the greatest "butterfly and flower" shot of all time and I wouldn''t know. I''m not sure why I picked this shot out of 500 to give this particular comment to. I appreciate your efforts. Try harder.  At the very least, you''ll have a comment on your picture. We all like getting comments.  Perhaps I''ve given you some insight into my thought processes that are helpful. Perhaps you''ll think I''m just an idiot (and perhaps I am) and ignore my comment. But...when you see you have a comment, and you see that its this one, you''ll at least remember it. BTW. After some consternation I decided to give you a 6 rather than a non-vote. Thanks for listening :)', '2007-09-05 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
