(4061057, 571295, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really digging the textureless skin, too much neatimage?  Other than that this shot is pretty cool.</td>', 'Not really digging the textureless skin, too much neatimage?  Other than that this shot is pretty cool.', '2007-09-05 11:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
