(4061074, 579654, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well I don´t want to say the makeup is not well done but it is not really convincing either, if her shoulder is supposed to be an open wound it doesn´t really look like it.  Also, not wanting to sound like a perv, I would have asked her to wear something that left her shoulders bare, the white top looks a bit out of place, the bare shoulders would have fitted more or something black, like a leather jacket or something.</td>', 'Well I don´t want to say the makeup is not well done but it is not really convincing either, if her shoulder is supposed to be an open wound it doesn´t really look like it.  Also, not wanting to sound like a perv, I would have asked her to wear something that left her shoulders bare, the white top looks a bit out of place, the bare shoulders would have fitted more or something black, like a leather jacket or something.', '2007-09-05 11:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061075, 579695, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2007-09-05 11:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061079, 578703, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool statue, where is it?</td>', 'Cool statue, where is it?', '2007-09-05 11:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061085, 574756, 27482, '<td valign="top">This shot is pretty cool but still, the black areas are too black for my taste, a bit of texture there would have gotten a higher score from me but I still gave a 7.</td>', 'This shot is pretty cool but still, the black areas are too black for my taste, a bit of texture there would have gotten a higher score from me but I still gave a 7.', '2007-09-05 11:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061111, 575211, 83773, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2007-09-05 11:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061154, 573495, 27482, '<td valign="top">There is something very unattural about the lighting, guess it´s taken at a zoo indoors or did you actually use an off camera flash from the right to light this?  Anyway, the harsh lighting and shadow just don´t seem to fit with this image in my opinion.</td>', 'There is something very unattural about the lighting, guess it´s taken at a zoo indoors or did you actually use an off camera flash from the right to light this?  Anyway, the harsh lighting and shadow just don´t seem to fit with this image in my opinion.', '2007-09-05 11:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061159, 566993, 27482, '<td valign="top">Image quality looks a bit off and since there are not really any interesting colors in the shot, did you try to make it b/w, that would have masked the lack of image quality a lot.  Cool shot other than that but would have been even cooler had you taken it in the deeper end of the pool.</td>', 'Image quality looks a bit off and since there are not really any interesting colors in the shot, did you try to make it b/w, that would have masked the lack of image quality a lot.  Cool shot other than that but would have been even cooler had you taken it in the deeper end of the pool.', '2007-09-05 11:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061168, 579029, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hehe, I´d volunteer too :)  WB seems a bit off, did you remember to set it to fluorescent?</td>', 'Hehe, I´d volunteer too :)  WB seems a bit off, did you remember to set it to fluorescent?', '2007-09-05 11:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061170, 576178, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit too artsy for my taste but still, well done and I gave a 6 wich is unusually high for me and digital art images at DPC.</td>', 'A bit too artsy for my taste but still, well done and I gave a 6 wich is unusually high for me and digital art images at DPC.', '2007-09-05 11:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061172, 579937, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice but I just have seen so many great photos from Oregon beach I kind of can´t help but compare them and this doesn´t really stack up as anything above average in that regard.</td>', 'Nice but I just have seen so many great photos from Oregon beach I kind of can´t help but compare them and this doesn´t really stack up as anything above average in that regard.', '2007-09-05 12:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061178, 579574, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hmm, this looks familiar...  Editing is way over the top for my taste, that sky just looks, well sorry if I am rude, but it looks awful.  Still gave a 5 since I like the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Hmm, this looks familiar...  Editing is way over the top for my taste, that sky just looks, well sorry if I am rude, but it looks awful.  Still gave a 5 since I like the rest of the photo.', '2007-09-05 12:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061181, 575211, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w, great tones and contrast.</td>', 'Nice b/w, great tones and contrast.', '2007-09-05 12:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4061185, 575308, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this is not really stacking up to the rest of the entries in the challenge, it just looks like a snapshot of something you had laying around, there is nothing interesting about it wether that be lighting, colors or setting.  Just wanted to explain why I gave a 3.</td>', 'Sorry but this is not really stacking up to the rest of the entries in the challenge, it just looks like a snapshot of something you had laying around, there is nothing interesting about it wether that be lighting, colors or setting.  Just wanted to explain why I gave a 3.', '2007-09-05 12:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
