(4061456, 576167, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well not bad but still, not really to my taste.  I do realize that is intentional, hence the title but the fact is that the sky doesn´t match the reflection just isn´t to my taste, think it should be the other way around, the reflection should give it away as a hazardous place to be, that´s just my gut reaction.  Also I am not really digging the foliage in the foreground, just want to remove it so I can see the reflection better but that´s also not a big drawback.  Gave a 6.</td>', 'Well not bad but still, not really to my taste.  I do realize that is intentional, hence the title but the fact is that the sky doesn´t match the reflection just isn´t to my taste, think it should be the other way around, the reflection should give it away as a hazardous place to be, that´s just my gut reaction.  Also I am not really digging the foliage in the foreground, just want to remove it so I can see the reflection better but that´s also not a big drawback.  Gave a 6.', '2007-09-05 12:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
