(4061485, 579285, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well first of all, great tones, contrast and colors.  I think this shot is pretty cool but still, the extra paws kindof kills it for me personally, that and the pink thing that is to the side of the tigre.  I just wish it was more subtly mirrored and that it would really take a few seconds to get that it was really mirrored and the paw and pink thingy kind of ruin that element of surprise.  Gave a 7 as this is done extremely well technically.</td>', 'Well first of all, great tones, contrast and colors.  I think this shot is pretty cool but still, the extra paws kindof kills it for me personally, that and the pink thing that is to the side of the tigre.  I just wish it was more subtly mirrored and that it would really take a few seconds to get that it was really mirrored and the paw and pink thingy kind of ruin that element of surprise.  Gave a 7 as this is done extremely well technically.', '2007-09-05 13:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
