(4061616, 579753, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don´t want to be rude but that lizard there, why did you put it there and how exactly do you think it improves this picture?  I can only speak for myself but I would have liked this shot heaps better without it and well if you had to place it there, I emplore you to spend more time on it and make it fit better and not blur it, also look at the lighting on stuff you plan to place in and see if it matches the scene.  Still gave a 5 despite the lizard as I like the rest of the shot, the color tones and the sky in particular.</td>', 'Sorry, I don´t want to be rude but that lizard there, why did you put it there and how exactly do you think it improves this picture?  I can only speak for myself but I would have liked this shot heaps better without it and well if you had to place it there, I emplore you to spend more time on it and make it fit better and not blur it, also look at the lighting on stuff you plan to place in and see if it matches the scene.  Still gave a 5 despite the lizard as I like the rest of the shot, the color tones and the sky in particular.', '2007-09-05 13:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
