(4062181, 579886, 67258, '<td valign="top">I really like the last two photographs in this triptych, but for me it is let down by the first.  The first one just doesn''t have the same air and deep emotions of the ohers - if anything it looks awkward, unclear, and vaguely clinical.</td>', 'I really like the last two photographs in this triptych, but for me it is let down by the first.  The first one just doesn''t have the same air and deep emotions of the ohers - if anything it looks awkward, unclear, and vaguely clinical.', '2007-09-05 16:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4062183, 574756, 67258, '<td valign="top">Of all the images that I have viewed so far that have relied heavily on digital art, this is by far he most successful.  The sense of mood that it evokes is superb.</td>', 'Of all the images that I have viewed so far that have relied heavily on digital art, this is by far he most successful.  The sense of mood that it evokes is superb.', '2007-09-05 16:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4062185, 569919, 67258, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lighting - well observed.</td>', 'Gorgeous lighting - well observed.', '2007-09-05 16:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4062193, 579295, 67258, '<td valign="top">An amazing mural, but this is far from just relying on another artist''s work.  The pose and placement of your model, leaning against the work bench adds even more.  Strong work.</td>', 'An amazing mural, but this is far from just relying on another artist''s work.  The pose and placement of your model, leaning against the work bench adds even more.  Strong work.', '2007-09-05 16:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
