(4063313, 579879, 43463, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the soft look of this photo for it invokes the feel of downy softness and delicate nature which perfectly complements this adorable little girl. Soft yellows and downy white hues are also complimentary in this baby portrait.  The only thing that really needs to be present to make this photo shine &amp; move into the above average category is that the viewer needs to see her face. The above shot angle and barely side profile just doesn''t do it. We need to see her adorable face to compliment &amp; complete this lovely portrait.</td>', 'Absolutely love the soft look of this photo for it invokes the feel of downy softness and delicate nature which perfectly complements this adorable little girl. Soft yellows and downy white hues are also complimentary in this baby portrait.  The only thing that really needs to be present to make this photo shine & move into the above average category is that the viewer needs to see her face. The above shot angle and barely side profile just doesn''t do it. We need to see her adorable face to compliment & complete this lovely portrait.', '2007-09-05 22:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4063326, 579452, 67883, '<td valign="top">To much empty space in the bottom... also some sensor dust.</td>', 'To much empty space in the bottom... also some sensor dust.', '2007-09-05 22:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4063332, 579185, 14476, '<td valign="top">Okay, I like a good nature story, and you have one going here.  <br/>Um, but.  There''s quite a lot going on in this image, and since it was expert editing, it would have been okay to take out some of it, like that top branch and leaf.  And then, maybe blur out the background just a bit more...  Oh, heck, you really do have a <b>very good</b> find here.  I''m not going to mess with that good find any more...</td>', 'Okay, I like a good nature story, and you have one going here.  Um, but.  There''s quite a lot going on in this image, and since it was expert editing, it would have been okay to take out some of it, like that top branch and leaf.  And then, maybe blur out the background just a bit more...  Oh, heck, you really do have a very good find here.  I''m not going to mess with that good find any more...', '2007-09-05 22:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4063333, 577079, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the lovely green hues seen on the butterfly and the leaf it rests on. Very nice sharp detail on the wings and the textures of the leaf. I like how the DOF is shallow and that it has a bokeh look background for the butterfly to pop off of.</td>', 'Love the lovely green hues seen on the butterfly and the leaf it rests on. Very nice sharp detail on the wings and the textures of the leaf. I like how the DOF is shallow and that it has a bokeh look background for the butterfly to pop off of.', '2007-09-05 22:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4063336, 579584, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract;  would be interesting to see how a little noise reduction would have affected it...</td>', 'Nice abstract;  would be interesting to see how a little noise reduction would have affected it...', '2007-09-05 22:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4063339, 579716, 14476, '<td valign="top">Well, you found a good story and went with it and made it even more dramatic.  Good seeing.</td>', 'Well, you found a good story and went with it and made it even more dramatic.  Good seeing.', '2007-09-05 22:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
