(4064058, 579865, 31637, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, that sky looks scary.</td>', 'Nice composition, that sky looks scary.', '2007-09-06 01:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064064, 577484, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, over sharpened though. Easy on the sharpening and the sky is over saturated for my tastes. This composition is very nice !</td>', 'Great contrast, over sharpened though. Easy on the sharpening and the sky is over saturated for my tastes. This composition is very nice !', '2007-09-06 01:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064099, 579686, 69776, '<td valign="top">Hmmm very interesting idea.  I don''t like the blue, looks too dead for me, but good job on the pp</td>', 'Hmmm very interesting idea.  I don''t like the blue, looks too dead for me, but good job on the pp', '2007-09-06 01:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064101, 579863, 69776, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, the BW looks good</td>', 'Nice lighting, the BW looks good', '2007-09-06 01:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064102, 579932, 69776, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but Im getting dead not dreaming</td>', 'Nice idea, but Im getting dead not dreaming', '2007-09-06 01:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064103, 579004, 69776, '<td valign="top">Well done with the tools you have, Darn hard to do too.  Good luck</td>', 'Well done with the tools you have, Darn hard to do too.  Good luck', '2007-09-06 01:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064105, 579250, 69776, '<td valign="top">Nice image, the engine on the boat looks out of place, looks like it should have oars, Nice depth to the shot</td>', 'Nice image, the engine on the boat looks out of place, looks like it should have oars, Nice depth to the shot', '2007-09-06 01:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064107, 579194, 69776, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shots, it looks a bit unnatural in the v.  Good job on the red mons as I know just how damn hard it was to do.  Good luck</td>', 'Nice crisp shots, it looks a bit unnatural in the v.  Good job on the red mons as I know just how damn hard it was to do.  Good luck', '2007-09-06 01:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064108, 579512, 69776, '<td valign="top">Nice dof, and nice sharp focus.  Good luck</td>', 'Nice dof, and nice sharp focus.  Good luck', '2007-09-06 01:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064135, 579856, 29269, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see the top of the mouth...</td>', 'I wish I could see the top of the mouth...', '2007-09-06 02:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064145, 579842, 29269, '<td valign="top">I can see that there are only 3 people in the photo, and I find it very interesting, but I can''t grasp the concept of asymmetric white space op top and the bottom...</td>', 'I can see that there are only 3 people in the photo, and I find it very interesting, but I can''t grasp the concept of asymmetric white space op top and the bottom...', '2007-09-06 02:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064185, 579452, 29269, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s the purpose of the extensive blurry space at the bottom of the photo. Some - OK, but more than a half - too much, IMO.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s the purpose of the extensive blurry space at the bottom of the photo. Some - OK, but more than a half - too much, IMO.', '2007-09-06 02:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064327, 579545, 83758, '<td valign="top">I like photos where you wonder what is being thought... I wonder what the dog is thinking? Technically not up there with the best in the category of expert post production, but an interesting composition, so the eye''s have it!</td>', 'I like photos where you wonder what is being thought... I wonder what the dog is thinking? Technically not up there with the best in the category of expert post production, but an interesting composition, so the eye''s have it!', '2007-09-06 04:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064328, 579091, 83758, '<td valign="top">Arty and graphic... very nice composition and production.</td>', 'Arty and graphic... very nice composition and production.', '2007-09-06 04:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064413, 579649, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yes.<br/> <br/>I am not posthumous nor e301 so it may not count for much, but were I to give a blue ribbon, you''d get it.</td>', 'Yes. I am not posthumous nor e301 so it may not count for much, but were I to give a blue ribbon, you''d get it.', '2007-09-06 07:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064415, 579927, 27482, '<td valign="top">First of all, I love the sky even though it looks heavily processed, it´s right up my alley in regards to taste, great texture and 3-D look.  I do not like the foreground, too HDR and way too bright to fit in with that sky, I would have wanted to see it very dark but still with some details.  That´s why I "only" voted a 7 :)</td>', 'First of all, I love the sky even though it looks heavily processed, it´s right up my alley in regards to taste, great texture and 3-D look.  I do not like the foreground, too HDR and way too bright to fit in with that sky, I would have wanted to see it very dark but still with some details.  That´s why I "only" voted a 7 :)', '2007-09-06 07:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064417, 571109, 27482, '<td valign="top">Way too small to vote fairly on.</td>', 'Way too small to vote fairly on.', '2007-09-06 07:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064418, 576942, 27482, '<td valign="top">I assume the city skyline is added afterwards and in that case I would have placed it up in the upper right corner and not the left, that just would have given this photo better balance in the composition.</td>', 'I assume the city skyline is added afterwards and in that case I would have placed it up in the upper right corner and not the left, that just would have given this photo better balance in the composition.', '2007-09-06 07:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064420, 579515, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but too noisy for my taste and also subject is as centered as could be, try reading up on the rule of thirds and go from there.</td>', 'Sorry but too noisy for my taste and also subject is as centered as could be, try reading up on the rule of thirds and go from there.', '2007-09-06 07:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064421, 568728, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the birds, they add something to the shot</td>', 'Nice, I like the birds, they add something to the shot', '2007-09-06 07:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064423, 579647, 27482, '<td valign="top">Kindof wish the Dolphin was also in focus or save that, rather it than the kid was in focus, I mean an out of focus silhouette is still a silhouette with no details, you get my drift.  Nice shot though, gave a 6.</td>', 'Kindof wish the Dolphin was also in focus or save that, rather it than the kid was in focus, I mean an out of focus silhouette is still a silhouette with no details, you get my drift.  Nice shot though, gave a 6.', '2007-09-06 07:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064424, 574463, 27482, '<td valign="top">Way to flat contrast wise for my taste, also too bright.</td>', 'Way to flat contrast wise for my taste, also too bright.', '2007-09-06 07:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064425, 579208, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed</td>', 'Nicely composed', '2007-09-06 07:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064426, 577595, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pity about the blown sky, this would have been a good opportunity for you to try out some HDR since the rules allowed it.</td>', 'Pity about the blown sky, this would have been a good opportunity for you to try out some HDR since the rules allowed it.', '2007-09-06 07:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064428, 564832, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great DOF but just a bit too dark for my taste.</td>', 'Great DOF but just a bit too dark for my taste.', '2007-09-06 07:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064429, 570371, 27482, '<td valign="top">I usually dislike softfocus but it´s nicely used in this photo, gave a 6.</td>', 'I usually dislike softfocus but it´s nicely used in this photo, gave a 6.', '2007-09-06 07:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064430, 579793, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I always think that shot´s with fake lens blur don´t come out as well as the real thing, it´s not badly done but it just doesn´t have that same look as the real thing.  Nice shot though, gave a 6.</td>', 'Sorry but I always think that shot´s with fake lens blur don´t come out as well as the real thing, it´s not badly done but it just doesn´t have that same look as the real thing.  Nice shot though, gave a 6.', '2007-09-06 07:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064432, 579704, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well not bad but still this is more of a digital art shot than a photograph to me and frankly I don´t want to see images like this in challenges even though the rules allow it.  Sure, I am all for composites but only those that make up for a great photo, like adding another backround and stuff like that.  I still respect the work that went into this and voted a 5.  Just think Moses or whoever that is supposed to be is a bit off in regards to the lighting, I would have darkened the left side of him judging by the shadow he cast´s.</td>', 'Well not bad but still this is more of a digital art shot than a photograph to me and frankly I don´t want to see images like this in challenges even though the rules allow it.  Sure, I am all for composites but only those that make up for a great photo, like adding another backround and stuff like that.  I still respect the work that went into this and voted a 5.  Just think Moses or whoever that is supposed to be is a bit off in regards to the lighting, I would have darkened the left side of him judging by the shadow he cast´s.', '2007-09-06 07:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064442, 571021, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad moment but the image quality is sub par compared to the best surf photos, whether you set the ISO too high or you are using an inferior lens, that seems to be the problem here, not the photographer.</td>', 'Not a bad moment but the image quality is sub par compared to the best surf photos, whether you set the ISO too high or you are using an inferior lens, that seems to be the problem here, not the photographer.', '2007-09-06 07:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064443, 579418, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark for my taste, I would have brightened this by half a stop or something to that effect.</td>', 'A bit too dark for my taste, I would have brightened this by half a stop or something to that effect.', '2007-09-06 07:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064446, 578909, 27482, '<td valign="top">Compared to the others who had the same idea, I like the layout of the moon and exposure but the foreground is just not working for me at all.</td>', 'Compared to the others who had the same idea, I like the layout of the moon and exposure but the foreground is just not working for me at all.', '2007-09-06 07:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064447, 568794, 27482, '<td valign="top">Way too small to be able to rate it fairly</td>', 'Way too small to be able to rate it fairly', '2007-09-06 07:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064448, 575896, 27482, '<td valign="top">Don´t really dig the halo that came from the post processing but other than that I like the colors.</td>', 'Don´t really dig the halo that came from the post processing but other than that I like the colors.', '2007-09-06 07:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064449, 576279, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit flat contrast wise since all the color tones are so alike.</td>', 'A bit flat contrast wise since all the color tones are so alike.', '2007-09-06 07:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064468, 577945, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this is not a bad picture but still, nothing really interesting about it either, this is just a photo I would expect to see if someone was advertising that horse for sale but there is nothing artistic about it.</td>', 'Well this is not a bad picture but still, nothing really interesting about it either, this is just a photo I would expect to see if someone was advertising that horse for sale but there is nothing artistic about it.', '2007-09-06 08:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
