(4064753, 579488, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nice way of displaying the eclipse!  My only nitpick is that in several phases of the moon, you chopped it out in a non-circular fashion, leaving blue sky where there should be the blackness of the moon.  It looks as though the moon had been bitten off in pieces, rather than just shadowed.  Still a fine shot, though -- great idea!</td>', 'Very nice way of displaying the eclipse!  My only nitpick is that in several phases of the moon, you chopped it out in a non-circular fashion, leaving blue sky where there should be the blackness of the moon.  It looks as though the moon had been bitten off in pieces, rather than just shadowed.  Still a fine shot, though -- great idea!', '2007-09-06 10:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064769, 568916, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely shape and nice timing on the capture.  Highlights look a little blown on my monitor.</td>', 'Lovely shape and nice timing on the capture.  Highlights look a little blown on my monitor.', '2007-09-06 10:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064775, 575179, 3102, '<td valign="top">You''d think Homeland Security would have determined that the name of this waterfall would have to be changed... wouldn''t put it past ''em!  :)  Beautiful shot.</td>', 'You''d think Homeland Security would have determined that the name of this waterfall would have to be changed... wouldn''t put it past ''em!  :)  Beautiful shot.', '2007-09-06 10:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4064777, 574077, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute kitten (but aren''t they all?).  I''d like a little sharper focus on the eyes and would probably crop off most of the negative space on the left as I don''t feel it enhances the image.</td>', 'Cute kitten (but aren''t they all?).  I''d like a little sharper focus on the eyes and would probably crop off most of the negative space on the left as I don''t feel it enhances the image.', '2007-09-06 10:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
