(4067402, 578722, 29011, '<td valign="top">Ah the wonderful west coast! Excellent shot and treatment. Didn''t go overboard with the hdr look and/or photo adjustments. The bottom right greens looks a tad overaly bright than the rest of the greens and that does make it one of the focal points. The moon must''ve forced you to shoot wide, as it''s a wonderful scene. Only nitpick , perhaps cloning out the branches sticking out around mid frame, near the right edge there?<br/>A very easy and impulsive 9 from me :)<br/> <br/>p.s. I only know of 4 DPC members which shoot around the area and would like to be surprised ;)</td>', 'Ah the wonderful west coast! Excellent shot and treatment. Didn''t go overboard with the hdr look and/or photo adjustments. The bottom right greens looks a tad overaly bright than the rest of the greens and that does make it one of the focal points. The moon must''ve forced you to shoot wide, as it''s a wonderful scene. Only nitpick , perhaps cloning out the branches sticking out around mid frame, near the right edge there?A very easy and impulsive 9 from me :) p.s. I only know of 4 DPC members which shoot around the area and would like to be surprised ;)', '2007-09-07 00:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
