(4069070, 575855, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  Terrific perspective and I love the lighting on the man, and the resulting shadow.  He looks tentative, and we can''t see what he''s seeing, which leaves much to the imagination.  Like this a lot :-)</td>', 'Beautifully done.  Terrific perspective and I love the lighting on the man, and the resulting shadow.  He looks tentative, and we can''t see what he''s seeing, which leaves much to the imagination.  Like this a lot :-)', '2007-09-07 13:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069079, 572867, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but the image is completely overwhelmed by the frame and that doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'Sorry, but the image is completely overwhelmed by the frame and that doesn''t appeal to me.', '2007-09-07 13:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069090, 577948, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gotta'' say, that eye on the right looks very creepy.  The background being the same color as her iris is very complementary to her, but that bit of white between the hair strands where I expect to see the other iris keeps me from seeing this as a pretty potrait.  Not entirely sure what you were going for  here.</td>', 'Gotta'' say, that eye on the right looks very creepy.  The background being the same color as her iris is very complementary to her, but that bit of white between the hair strands where I expect to see the other iris keeps me from seeing this as a pretty potrait.  Not entirely sure what you were going for  here.', '2007-09-07 13:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069097, 574756, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, my.  I don''t think I''d care to encounter this guy anywhere.</td>', 'Oh, my.  I don''t think I''d care to encounter this guy anywhere.', '2007-09-07 13:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
