(4069161, 579216, 30861, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think you''d have been better served with just the top panel and more of the mantis showing, but an amazing confrontation regardless and very well lit and captured.</td>', 'Personally, I think you''d have been better served with just the top panel and more of the mantis showing, but an amazing confrontation regardless and very well lit and captured.', '2007-09-07 13:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
