(4069183, 579250, 30861, '<td valign="top">The foreground clump of grass is too centered for me, and is drawing my eye strongly as a focal point, which is too bad. In all other respects a lovely composition.</td>', 'The foreground clump of grass is too centered for me, and is drawing my eye strongly as a focal point, which is too bad. In all other respects a lovely composition.', '2007-09-07 13:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
