(4069283, 579704, 66952, '<td valign="top">Kind of like Dali, only with old testament themes. I suppose it would be too much to ask to get rid of the tire tracks in the dirt, but it''s a thought provoking piece.</td>', 'Kind of like Dali, only with old testament themes. I suppose it would be too much to ask to get rid of the tire tracks in the dirt, but it''s a thought provoking piece.', '2007-09-07 14:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
