(4069591, 573599, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Great colours and I love the yachts picked out against the dark water.<br/> <br/>In terms of possible improvements - the horizon doesn''t quite look straight to me, and I think if you had put a very fine white line inside your frame it would have helped seperate the frame from the picture, especially at the bottom. The frame is only personal taste though  :-  )<br/> <br/>Still a very nice shot. Well done.<br/> <br/>back to bump  :  )</td>', 'Very nice shot. Great colours and I love the yachts picked out against the dark water. In terms of possible improvements - the horizon doesn''t quite look straight to me, and I think if you had put a very fine white line inside your frame it would have helped seperate the frame from the picture, especially at the bottom. The frame is only personal taste though  :-  ) Still a very nice shot. Well done. back to bump  :  )', '2007-09-07 16:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
