(4069655, 579346, 68586, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot to like about this picture. <br/> <br/>I love the colours, the slope of the land, the sun behind the stones, the distance between the objects in the foreground and the background.<br/> <br/>The only unresolved tension for me is that the tanker should either have been somehow worked into the title, or, lost in the editing.<br/> <br/>That aside a very nice shot.</td>', 'There''s a lot to like about this picture.  I love the colours, the slope of the land, the sun behind the stones, the distance between the objects in the foreground and the background. The only unresolved tension for me is that the tanker should either have been somehow worked into the title, or, lost in the editing. That aside a very nice shot.', '2007-09-07 16:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
