(4069934, 575714, 18738, '<td valign="top">Is that why you tell us twice? :-)</td>', 'Is that why you tell us twice? :-)', '2007-09-07 18:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069940, 579725, 18738, '<td valign="top">It looks familiar.</td>', 'It looks familiar.', '2007-09-07 18:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069941, 579739, 18738, '<td valign="top">That''s a pleasantly honest title.</td>', 'That''s a pleasantly honest title.', '2007-09-07 18:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069945, 579934, 18738, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2007-09-07 18:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069958, 579663, 18738, '<td valign="top">It''s good, but I have to ask myself why they are falling from the umbrella and not the sky. <br/> <br/>I know the practical reason, but often in shots like these, it''s that kind of logical disconnect that mars the photo far more than the unreality of the original idea.<br/> <br/>It''s still refreshing enough for many points.</td>', 'It''s good, but I have to ask myself why they are falling from the umbrella and not the sky.  I know the practical reason, but often in shots like these, it''s that kind of logical disconnect that mars the photo far more than the unreality of the original idea. It''s still refreshing enough for many points.', '2007-09-07 18:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069962, 579823, 18738, '<td valign="top">I love it.</td>', 'I love it.', '2007-09-07 18:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4069973, 579726, 74979, '<td valign="top">beautiful light!!</td>', 'beautiful light!!', '2007-09-07 18:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070217, 579725, 83906, '<td valign="top">very sharp focus. Great use of line and great contrast.</td>', 'very sharp focus. Great use of line and great contrast.', '2007-09-07 19:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070220, 564832, 83906, '<td valign="top">Great texture.</td>', 'Great texture.', '2007-09-07 19:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070223, 575860, 81362, '<td valign="top">High score from me. I like the moody tone as well as the contrast between the building''s decorative artwork and the grime and droppings of an older urban setting. Good environemntal portrait of the guitarist. Wish I could  see her face, but it is artistic as is. Street musicians are generally underappreciated.</td>', 'High score from me. I like the moody tone as well as the contrast between the building''s decorative artwork and the grime and droppings of an older urban setting. Good environemntal portrait of the guitarist. Wish I could  see her face, but it is artistic as is. Street musicians are generally underappreciated.', '2007-09-07 19:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4070224, 577834, 83906, '<td valign="top">I love the fluid, liquid feel of this. Great depth of field.</td>', 'I love the fluid, liquid feel of this. Great depth of field.', '2007-09-07 19:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
