(4071071, 579754, 50695, '<td valign="top">fascinating mix of the fantastic and the mundane. a daydream. interestingly, we are more watching her dream, than seeing the dreams themselves. And it''s better that way. We watch her not in her dream, but at least wearing her dream. Yes, the pool has turned into a lake, but look how empty it is. She is seeing much more than we are.</td>', 'fascinating mix of the fantastic and the mundane. a daydream. interestingly, we are more watching her dream, than seeing the dreams themselves. And it''s better that way. We watch her not in her dream, but at least wearing her dream. Yes, the pool has turned into a lake, but look how empty it is. She is seeing much more than we are.', '2007-09-08 00:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
