(4071124, 574619, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is a great example of what a daring composition (they are talking about "open composition" in the impressionism thread. this is a great example) and a daring use of light can achieve. By seeing the source of the light, and seeing it unflinchingly as it hits their forms, this photo has an immediacy that it would otherwise be lacking. Tremendous. 10</td>', 'this is a great example of what a daring composition (they are talking about "open composition" in the impressionism thread. this is a great example) and a daring use of light can achieve. By seeing the source of the light, and seeing it unflinchingly as it hits their forms, this photo has an immediacy that it would otherwise be lacking. Tremendous. 10', '2007-09-08 00:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4071126, 579403, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how this flips between pure abstract and a photo of a child playing in a fountain.</td>', 'I like how this flips between pure abstract and a photo of a child playing in a fountain.', '2007-09-08 00:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
