(4071664, 579707, 35720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Larus:</b></div><hr/><i> Cool shot, the ground has a bit too strong colors to make it believable as a true nightshot as usually these colors fade in the nightlight but still, that´s not bothering me much and I really like this shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your comment Lárus, but this is not a nightshot, it''s taken at 11.14 a.m.<br/> <br/>Many thanks for great comments everyone!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-08 04:56:08.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Larus: Cool shot, the ground has a bit too strong colors to make it believable as a true nightshot as usually these colors fade in the nightlight but still, that´s not bothering me much and I really like this shot.   Thanks for your comment Lárus, but this is not a nightshot, it''s taken at 11.14 a.m. Many thanks for great comments everyone!', '2007-09-08 05:55:50.000000', '2007-09-08 05:56:08.000000', 0),
