(4071695, 578432, 30982, '<td valign="top">Your part of the world is far more civilized than where I''ve been - or so it appears from this!  I thought you''d put a Marine over a shot taken from elsewhere but now that I think about it, that wouldn''t have been possible given the time frame of the shoot.  I do like this.  And tell Corey she''s a good sport for getting up at 6 am!</td>', 'Your part of the world is far more civilized than where I''ve been - or so it appears from this!  I thought you''d put a Marine over a shot taken from elsewhere but now that I think about it, that wouldn''t have been possible given the time frame of the shoot.  I do like this.  And tell Corey she''s a good sport for getting up at 6 am!', '2007-09-08 06:46:25.000000', NULL, 0),
