(4071740, 579375, 75034, '<td valign="top">Thank you<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=73601" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">JeffDay</a> I was hopeing to do a little better on the capture but the bird flew away and this was as claoe as we could get. I was also hopeing to do a little better in the standings but I have so much to learn. Free Study is a tough place to post a photo. :-} <br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Thank you JeffDay I was hopeing to do a little better on the capture but the bird flew away and this was as claoe as we could get. I was also hopeing to do a little better in the standings but I have so much to learn. Free Study is a tough place to post a photo. :-}  MAX!', '2007-09-08 07:51:26.000000', NULL, 0),
