(4071792, 579509, 30982, '<td valign="top">It must be tough when you have such delightful shots to choose from!  Haven''t checked yet, but hopefully you put the other one in your portfolio, too.  They''re cute little guys!  The one thing I see in your work (and it''s been there all along - you just keep getting better at it) is dedication to what you want to create and the knowledge of the tools you need to do it.  The "for instance" here is the chosen aperture to achieve what you wanted.</td>', 'It must be tough when you have such delightful shots to choose from!  Haven''t checked yet, but hopefully you put the other one in your portfolio, too.  They''re cute little guys!  The one thing I see in your work (and it''s been there all along - you just keep getting better at it) is dedication to what you want to create and the knowledge of the tools you need to do it.  The "for instance" here is the chosen aperture to achieve what you wanted.', '2007-09-08 08:20:54.000000', NULL, 0),
