(4071804, 574122, 30982, '<td valign="top">None of these shots sucks.  Not a one.  It''s a delight to see what you come up with for challenges, and just in general.  Glad to see you had fun with the wide angle.  What I like about the challenge entry in particular are the strong foreground lines.  Gives it power somehow.  And I quite like the shadow of the person, too.</td>', 'None of these shots sucks.  Not a one.  It''s a delight to see what you come up with for challenges, and just in general.  Glad to see you had fun with the wide angle.  What I like about the challenge entry in particular are the strong foreground lines.  Gives it power somehow.  And I quite like the shadow of the person, too.', '2007-09-08 08:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4071812, 578962, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting editing from you - would not have thought this yours.  My favorite part (other than what I commented during the challenge) is in the text - "The floor was sufficiently blue."  I think there''s an entire poem there somewhere.</td>', 'Interesting editing from you - would not have thought this yours.  My favorite part (other than what I commented during the challenge) is in the text - "The floor was sufficiently blue."  I think there''s an entire poem there somewhere.', '2007-09-08 08:27:47.000000', NULL, 0),
