(4072208, 579488, 42125, '<td valign="top">Really well done but the only thing I can point out in this spectacular photo that isn''t "right" is two stars inside the shadow on the 6th moon.</td>', 'Really well done but the only thing I can point out in this spectacular photo that isn''t "right" is two stars inside the shadow on the 6th moon.', '2007-09-08 12:11:35.000000', NULL, 0),
