(4072321, 579894, 8891, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=576480" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/721/120/576480.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/721/120/576480.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/721/120/576480.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=579419" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/721/120/579419.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/721/120/579419.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/721/120/579419.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Hmmmm.....Not sure I get your point. Care to elaborate?</td>', '   Hmmmm.....Not sure I get your point. Care to elaborate?', '2007-09-08 12:54:39.000000', NULL, 0),
