(4072483, 579599, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Deb. A 7 in FS is awesome. Actually, a 7 in any challenge is awesome. This is so beautiful. I notice that the far shore is rather industrial looking, but that is barely discernible the way you have processed this shot. It''s great to see there is still beauty in Iraq. I hope someday soon, the people of Iraq will be secure enough to again enjoy these sights you have been showing us.</td>', 'Congratulations, Deb. A 7 in FS is awesome. Actually, a 7 in any challenge is awesome. This is so beautiful. I notice that the far shore is rather industrial looking, but that is barely discernible the way you have processed this shot. It''s great to see there is still beauty in Iraq. I hope someday soon, the people of Iraq will be secure enough to again enjoy these sights you have been showing us.', '2007-09-08 14:06:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072485, 579181, 76676, '<td valign="top">Thia is EXCELLENT!! I love it!</td>', 'Thia is EXCELLENT!! I love it!', '2007-09-08 14:07:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072493, 579073, 37930, '<td valign="top">I knew this would place highly but there were so many other beautiful images that I couldn''t predict a winner. I''m glad to see an image with a sense of humor winning the blue, congrats on your ribbon =]</td>', 'I knew this would place highly but there were so many other beautiful images that I couldn''t predict a winner. I''m glad to see an image with a sense of humor winning the blue, congrats on your ribbon =]', '2007-09-08 14:10:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072508, 579509, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice going, Catherine -- good enough for a ribbon in some challenges. I like knowing that you set this up yourself, rather than just discovering it. You made those little models pay for the parsley. I curious how you accomplished the nice background bokeh with the long DOF. BTW, I like the variation in color between the two caterpillars.</td>', 'Nice going, Catherine -- good enough for a ribbon in some challenges. I like knowing that you set this up yourself, rather than just discovering it. You made those little models pay for the parsley. I curious how you accomplished the nice background bokeh with the long DOF. BTW, I like the variation in color between the two caterpillars.', '2007-09-08 14:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072520, 574122, 66384, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea having all that muck in the foreground. I probably would have moved forward more to avoid the muck, and then would have only had an ordinary pretty picture. What a good eye you have. The B&amp;W is very nice.</td>', 'Interesting idea having all that muck in the foreground. I probably would have moved forward more to avoid the muck, and then would have only had an ordinary pretty picture. What a good eye you have. The B&W is very nice.', '2007-09-08 14:22:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072531, 573495, 66384, '<td valign="top">It''s wonderful for you to have achieved exactly what you set out to do. Congratulations on a well composed shot. I think his somber expression is a hoot. I really enjoy looking at this little creature. The focus and DOF are great.</td>', 'It''s wonderful for you to have achieved exactly what you set out to do. Congratulations on a well composed shot. I think his somber expression is a hoot. I really enjoy looking at this little creature. The focus and DOF are great.', '2007-09-08 14:26:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072537, 575852, 66384, '<td valign="top">Ooooo, now that''s a pretty shot. I love the colors and lines and textures.</td>', 'Ooooo, now that''s a pretty shot. I love the colors and lines and textures.', '2007-09-08 14:30:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072543, 578983, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great idea putting that sparkly sky with the sparkly stadium. You are definitely the master of night photography! Beautiful detail and colors in the stadium. This can''t be the same game where you captured that throw to first base. Or maybe you were moving around in the stands for the different shots.</td>', 'Great idea putting that sparkly sky with the sparkly stadium. You are definitely the master of night photography! Beautiful detail and colors in the stadium. This can''t be the same game where you captured that throw to first base. Or maybe you were moving around in the stands for the different shots.', '2007-09-08 14:36:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072546, 578934, 74559, '<td valign="top">This is really great, excellent motion blur! Sorry to see it didn''t fare better. Since participating in the blur side challenge I''ve gained a much better appreciation for these types of images :-)</td>', 'This is really great, excellent motion blur! Sorry to see it didn''t fare better. Since participating in the blur side challenge I''ve gained a much better appreciation for these types of images :-)', '2007-09-08 14:37:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072553, 572314, 66384, '<td valign="top">This guy is adorable. I love his little hands. You did a good job on this, considering the light was working against you.</td>', 'This guy is adorable. I love his little hands. You did a good job on this, considering the light was working against you.', '2007-09-08 14:42:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072558, 579809, 61125, '<td valign="top">love it, don''t let the negative comments on "digital art" bum you.. there is an "expert editing" competition for a reason; allows for a different kind of creativity.. great job!</td>', 'love it, don''t let the negative comments on "digital art" bum you.. there is an "expert editing" competition for a reason; allows for a different kind of creativity.. great job!', '2007-09-08 14:47:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072562, 578962, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this. It''s interesting that you removed the detail and texture from the woman, while maintaining it in the sofa and rug.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this. It''s interesting that you removed the detail and texture from the woman, while maintaining it in the sofa and rug.', '2007-09-08 14:48:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072565, 577898, 74559, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the PB score, really well done!</td>', 'Congrats on the PB score, really well done!', '2007-09-08 14:50:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072599, 579599, 74559, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the high finish and PB! Beautiful color, so peaceful, just lovely!</td>', 'Congrats on the high finish and PB! Beautiful color, so peaceful, just lovely!', '2007-09-08 15:03:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072602, 578954, 14476, '<td valign="top">I agree with the others on the crop.  A crop at the edge of the last diagonal pavement line brings you right into the image.  Then, a little housecleaning to get rid of specks and the tiny bit of litter would help, and finally, since this was expert editing (advance editing would work for this suggestion too) try selecting the roadway and perhaps sidewalks and apply some Neat Image or Noise Ninja.  Bet you''ll like it.<br/>(I confess to voting this one a 5 as well...)</td>', 'I agree with the others on the crop.  A crop at the edge of the last diagonal pavement line brings you right into the image.  Then, a little housecleaning to get rid of specks and the tiny bit of litter would help, and finally, since this was expert editing (advance editing would work for this suggestion too) try selecting the roadway and perhaps sidewalks and apply some Neat Image or Noise Ninja.  Bet you''ll like it.(I confess to voting this one a 5 as well...)', '2007-09-08 15:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072603, 578571, 53964, '<td valign="top">Those eyes would make a great metallic brush :D</td>', 'Those eyes would make a great metallic brush :D', '2007-09-08 15:05:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072628, 579488, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow, I guess I need to see what''s legal in these challenges now a days.  Great shot, congrats!</td>', 'Wow, I guess I need to see what''s legal in these challenges now a days.  Great shot, congrats!', '2007-09-08 15:10:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072638, 579927, 714, '<td valign="top">The clouds are amazing!  Love the tones and colors here.  Great capture.</td>', 'The clouds are amazing!  Love the tones and colors here.  Great capture.', '2007-09-08 15:12:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072645, 577123, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow, Angela!  I would have been crapping my pants if I seen something like this come down at me.  Great capture and gutsy!</td>', 'Wow, Angela!  I would have been crapping my pants if I seen something like this come down at me.  Great capture and gutsy!', '2007-09-08 15:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072688, 578962, 61651, '<td valign="top">"The floor was sufficiently blue" would have made for a good title. :)  The artist that this work reminds me of is on the tip of my tongue and I just can''t get to it - I think this is brilliantly done.  A bit fauvist, too, maybe... Love those big blocks of rich color.  That you took an ordinary photograph (some would use the slur "snapshot") and thought to turn it into this fantastic study of color and form is stunning.  Would expect to see something just like this hanging on a wall at MOMA.</td>', '"The floor was sufficiently blue" would have made for a good title. :)  The artist that this work reminds me of is on the tip of my tongue and I just can''t get to it - I think this is brilliantly done.  A bit fauvist, too, maybe... Love those big blocks of rich color.  That you took an ordinary photograph (some would use the slur "snapshot") and thought to turn it into this fantastic study of color and form is stunning.  Would expect to see something just like this hanging on a wall at MOMA.', '2007-09-08 15:29:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072713, 575955, 5912, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this image was exported improperly for the Web and the colors appear much less saturated and has less contrast than the original. I''ve figured out the problem and now have the photo looking much better on  DPC. I was really disappointed that I didn''t catch the problem before I uploaded.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this image was exported improperly for the Web and the colors appear much less saturated and has less contrast than the original. I''ve figured out the problem and now have the photo looking much better on  DPC. I was really disappointed that I didn''t catch the problem before I uploaded.', '2007-09-08 15:37:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072714, 579073, 18450, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!! Congrats on your well deserved blue!</td>', 'Fantastic shot!! Congrats on your well deserved blue!', '2007-09-08 15:38:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072737, 578432, 48954, '<td valign="top">Great shot Corrie. You have a unique world to photograph, I would definitly consider making these shots public after the war or once you get home. I think it would do well. It''s also important to show a bit of that world as well...the good moments and not always the bad ones like we tend to see none stop now in Iraq ( not trying to tone down the horrors of the war here), Good work. I always enjoy going through your portfolio.</td>', 'Great shot Corrie. You have a unique world to photograph, I would definitly consider making these shots public after the war or once you get home. I think it would do well. It''s also important to show a bit of that world as well...the good moments and not always the bad ones like we tend to see none stop now in Iraq ( not trying to tone down the horrors of the war here), Good work. I always enjoy going through your portfolio.', '2007-09-08 15:47:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072742, 579821, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice finish Becky!! You have the knack for making the ordinary lovely! This is one beauty of a photo!</td>', 'Nice finish Becky!! You have the knack for making the ordinary lovely! This is one beauty of a photo!', '2007-09-08 15:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072755, 579827, 19178, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Another top 10!  Congratulations.</td>', 'Wow!  Another top 10!  Congratulations.', '2007-09-08 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072775, 579934, 67145, '<td valign="top">a mad and totally imaginative shot ..  you got some great comments which is excellent .. :)</td>', 'a mad and totally imaginative shot ..  you got some great comments which is excellent .. :)', '2007-09-08 16:22:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072787, 564926, 24962, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments! This was shot in my garden using my wife''s Canon A630. I did very little editing to it and the photo is a capture of the moment, with no trickery.</td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments! This was shot in my garden using my wife''s Canon A630. I did very little editing to it and the photo is a capture of the moment, with no trickery.', '2007-09-08 16:33:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072797, 571307, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the processing on this Terry. It has that old-time feel to it. Very nice job.</td>', 'I like the processing on this Terry. It has that old-time feel to it. Very nice job.', '2007-09-08 16:41:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072800, 574122, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very neat high  contrast shot.  The leading lines are fantastic. The only thing I would change would be to clone out the shadow of the person. Great Job.</td>', 'Very neat high  contrast shot.  The leading lines are fantastic. The only thing I would change would be to clone out the shadow of the person. Great Job.', '2007-09-08 16:43:45.000000', NULL, 0),
