(4072839, 579927, 38509, '<td valign="top">oh Yeah ! absolutely incredible ...really awesome ... <br/> <br/>thanks for this, i saw it this morning while browsing results and i thought to myself "wow this really rox"<br/> <br/>peace,<br/>goran</td>', 'oh Yeah ! absolutely incredible ...really awesome ...  thanks for this, i saw it this morning while browsing results and i thought to myself "wow this really rox" peace,goran', '2007-09-08 16:58:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072845, 578954, 15360, '<td valign="top">I like this symmetry in this image.  The truses in the distance appear slightly out of focus but I think that has more to do with position and lighting, than aperture.  If you shot that at f8 and 24mm as long as you focused on something more than 12'' away,  the depth of field should have been sufficient.<br/> <br/>Would like to see the color version.</td>', 'I like this symmetry in this image.  The truses in the distance appear slightly out of focus but I think that has more to do with position and lighting, than aperture.  If you shot that at f8 and 24mm as long as you focused on something more than 12'' away,  the depth of field should have been sufficient. Would like to see the color version.', '2007-09-08 17:05:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072847, 566418, 38509, '<td valign="top">congratz on your PB and breaking into 7''s :-)</td>', 'congratz on your PB and breaking into 7''s :-)', '2007-09-08 17:09:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072867, 566418, 66494, '<td valign="top">Congrats, great image. I''d be interested in finding out how you created thsi beauty.</td>', 'Congrats, great image. I''d be interested in finding out how you created thsi beauty.', '2007-09-08 17:39:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072872, 578983, 19978, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Absolutely beatiful!</td>', 'I love this shot. Absolutely beatiful!', '2007-09-08 17:42:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072875, 579663, 25355, '<td valign="top">Yes, the dotted pattern of the umbrella was the wrong choice; and though it would have been a real pain, another hundred or so gumdrops would have looked much better ;-Þ but overall, a fun shot.</td>', 'Yes, the dotted pattern of the umbrella was the wrong choice; and though it would have been a real pain, another hundred or so gumdrops would have looked much better ;-Þ but overall, a fun shot.', '2007-09-08 17:49:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4072882, 579488, 60698, '<td valign="top">Wow! I didn''t vote in this challenge and missed this absolute gem! It''s just gorgeous! I especially love the red flowers in the tree. It seems to bring out the orange moon! Congratulations on your first ribbon!</td>', 'Wow! I didn''t vote in this challenge and missed this absolute gem! It''s just gorgeous! I especially love the red flowers in the tree. It seems to bring out the orange moon! Congratulations on your first ribbon!', '2007-09-08 17:56:09.000000', NULL, 0),
