(4073054, 576941, 60047, '<td valign="top">If you look at the shadow on the mountain peak in the center, it appears to match well with the shadows on the balloon. The sun is obviously coming from a nine o''clock position. A very well done piece that is augmented by the stars (IMHO). The birds-but-no-stars rule is inconsistent and regrettable.</td>', 'If you look at the shadow on the mountain peak in the center, it appears to match well with the shadows on the balloon. The sun is obviously coming from a nine o''clock position. A very well done piece that is augmented by the stars (IMHO). The birds-but-no-stars rule is inconsistent and regrettable.', '2007-09-08 19:52:37.000000', NULL, 0),
