(4073408, 576622, 61651, '<td valign="top">There was something in the back of my brain that referenced that b&amp;w shot from the August blur thread - I thought of it, but didn''t think it was exactly the same one.  Nice to see this was you - love the way these branches meander all around the frame - with the brilliant greens, the shot has quite a lot energy.  Remarkable how you can get a completely different feel from the same shot depending on whether you present it in color or b&amp;w.</td>', 'There was something in the back of my brain that referenced that b&w shot from the August blur thread - I thought of it, but didn''t think it was exactly the same one.  Nice to see this was you - love the way these branches meander all around the frame - with the brilliant greens, the shot has quite a lot energy.  Remarkable how you can get a completely different feel from the same shot depending on whether you present it in color or b&w.', '2007-09-08 22:28:12.000000', NULL, 0),
