(4073928, 577945, 50695, '<td valign="top">This photo gave me a nice nostalgic feeling because it reminded me of a game I used to play that had pictures of horses. Dang, I can''t quite remember it... I think it was like a puzzle and everybody had to piece together a picture of a different horse.<br/> <br/>I find Larus''s comment interesting if odd. This would indeed be a good photo for selling this horse. It tells me so much about its beautiful shape and color and grooming. I find it odd that he thinks that selling something isn''t artistic since so many of his photos look like ads for jeans or perfume.</td>', 'This photo gave me a nice nostalgic feeling because it reminded me of a game I used to play that had pictures of horses. Dang, I can''t quite remember it... I think it was like a puzzle and everybody had to piece together a picture of a different horse. I find Larus''s comment interesting if odd. This would indeed be a good photo for selling this horse. It tells me so much about its beautiful shape and color and grooming. I find it odd that he thinks that selling something isn''t artistic since so many of his photos look like ads for jeans or perfume.', '2007-09-09 01:47:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4073990, 579599, 62318, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the score and placement! Two 7s, that is pretty impressive, though I do like your B&amp;W a tad better. This is still an excellent shot and field was so competitive.</td>', 'Congrats on the score and placement! Two 7s, that is pretty impressive, though I do like your B&W a tad better. This is still an excellent shot and field was so competitive.', '2007-09-09 02:12:40.000000', NULL, 0),
