(4074967, 579215, 63269, '<td valign="top">Oh how incrediblely sweet! I love this so much! So clever... house cats instead of lions. And of course the funny thing is it fits, since all cats are so arrogant (at least mine is) that they seem to think that running around in Africa with the lions would be perfectly natural. :) A definite fav, splendid image.</td>', 'Oh how incrediblely sweet! I love this so much! So clever... house cats instead of lions. And of course the funny thing is it fits, since all cats are so arrogant (at least mine is) that they seem to think that running around in Africa with the lions would be perfectly natural. :) A definite fav, splendid image.', '2007-09-09 13:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
