(4074985, 579419, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love it. This is awful to see images like this miss out on higher scores, because they''re almost digital art? <br/> <br/>And...maybe I''m going a bit too far by saying this, but personally, I''m not sure I understand why people get upset over "digital art" images. I think that expert editing challenges voters should be open to the digal art stuff. Just because it isn''t strictly photographic in nature doesn''t negate the fact that it''s a beautiful, shining image... Photoshop editing is a skill, too, right?? :) <br/> <br/>But anyways, stunning image. I love all the layers of colors, elements, and I guess I am a sucker for fantasy-type stuff on top of it all. Keep up the excellent work! :)</td>', 'I love it. This is awful to see images like this miss out on higher scores, because they''re almost digital art?  And...maybe I''m going a bit too far by saying this, but personally, I''m not sure I understand why people get upset over "digital art" images. I think that expert editing challenges voters should be open to the digal art stuff. Just because it isn''t strictly photographic in nature doesn''t negate the fact that it''s a beautiful, shining image... Photoshop editing is a skill, too, right?? :)  But anyways, stunning image. I love all the layers of colors, elements, and I guess I am a sucker for fantasy-type stuff on top of it all. Keep up the excellent work! :)', '2007-09-09 14:04:17.000000', NULL, 0),
