(4084465, 575335, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals:  Lighting is good.  It does have a slight tonemapped feel, but is certainly not overdone.  The tonemapping may have lowered your contrast in some areas a bit too much which lends a slightly flat feel.  The wide radius USM likely helped, but I''m looking for a tiny bit more.  The main bush is where I see this the most.<br/> <br/>The feel: Quaint.  One somewhat limiting factor is all the foilage is of the general same color.  This makes most of the shot blend and the bridge is the only thing that truly stands out.<br/> <br/>The game: It''s a nice shot.  I think people usually search for a little more "wow".  Getting "wow", however, is playing the game, not necessarily required for a good picture.</td>', 'Technicals:  Lighting is good.  It does have a slight tonemapped feel, but is certainly not overdone.  The tonemapping may have lowered your contrast in some areas a bit too much which lends a slightly flat feel.  The wide radius USM likely helped, but I''m looking for a tiny bit more.  The main bush is where I see this the most. The feel: Quaint.  One somewhat limiting factor is all the foilage is of the general same color.  This makes most of the shot blend and the bridge is the only thing that truly stands out. The game: It''s a nice shot.  I think people usually search for a little more "wow".  Getting "wow", however, is playing the game, not necessarily required for a good picture.', '2007-09-12 12:30:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4084615, 573899, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol a fish eye lens for a seafood meal?  Nice arrangement of the plates and I love the serious look on the chef.  Lighting came out really good in the photo.</td>', 'lol a fish eye lens for a seafood meal?  Nice arrangement of the plates and I love the serious look on the chef.  Lighting came out really good in the photo.', '2007-09-12 13:18:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4084670, 578943, 63269, '<td valign="top">INCREDIBLE. The atmosphere is intense and powerful here, and yes, <i>bitter</i>. Pinched almost. I tried to eat an acorn once. Uncooked, they taste awful. It was so bitter it formed a sort of numbing paste over my tongue, making the gravely chips of nut even worse. :) I was reminded of that acorn when I looked at your picture and read the title - only not as wildly awful a feeling. Awesome, awesome image.</td>', 'INCREDIBLE. The atmosphere is intense and powerful here, and yes, bitter. Pinched almost. I tried to eat an acorn once. Uncooked, they taste awful. It was so bitter it formed a sort of numbing paste over my tongue, making the gravely chips of nut even worse. :) I was reminded of that acorn when I looked at your picture and read the title - only not as wildly awful a feeling. Awesome, awesome image.', '2007-09-12 13:38:43.000000', NULL, 0),
