(4098157, 572878, 22042, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 8s just found this again while cruising for the walkabout side. Ok read your remarks and shape of face great, nose strong fits, Lips perfect, eyes OMG!!!! the word you were looking for was beautiful! Voters took it well, This voter was taken with it!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-25 03:19:54.</i></td>', 'I was one of your 8s just found this again while cruising for the walkabout side. Ok read your remarks and shape of face great, nose strong fits, Lips perfect, eyes OMG!!!! the word you were looking for was beautiful! Voters took it well, This voter was taken with it!', '2007-09-18 01:33:24.000000', '2008-01-25 03:19:54.000000', 0),
