(4099806, 579250, 52215, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much, i appreciate all comments.<br/>Now what is PB?</td>', 'Thank you very much, i appreciate all comments.Now what is PB?', '2007-09-18 21:16:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4099854, 579250, 42198, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by UAE_Guy:</b></div><hr/><i>Now what is PB?</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>PB = "Personal Best" i.e. This is now the highest scoring shot in your portfolio.<br/> <br/>Nice composition. But I find the lush green colours of the trees on the island don''t offset well against the grey clouds and the grey-ish water. Would have been interesting to see what sort of light you''d have got at sunrise or sunset.<br/> <br/>However, you got a nice sharp image here and a pretty good score for a Free Study (which are always tough to compete in)</td>', 'Originally posted by UAE_Guy:Now what is PB?  PB = "Personal Best" i.e. This is now the highest scoring shot in your portfolio. Nice composition. But I find the lush green colours of the trees on the island don''t offset well against the grey clouds and the grey-ish water. Would have been interesting to see what sort of light you''d have got at sunrise or sunset. However, you got a nice sharp image here and a pretty good score for a Free Study (which are always tough to compete in)', '2007-09-18 21:40:39.000000', NULL, 0),
