(4108320, 579546, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey tashy .. came to see wot you''ve been doing lately and started out with your last challenge .. once again the voters seem to be totally oblivious to the charms of this photograph .. when i look at this image i feel like she''s looking right at me .. its like there''s a real connection .. i dont agree with all the comments you had about needing more sharpening .. i think they''re only judging by dpc standards .. in the real world this would rank up there as something very special .. i think its excellent .. very real &amp; very dramatic in its way ... hope you''re travelling well .. :):)x</td>', 'hey tashy .. came to see wot you''ve been doing lately and started out with your last challenge .. once again the voters seem to be totally oblivious to the charms of this photograph .. when i look at this image i feel like she''s looking right at me .. its like there''s a real connection .. i dont agree with all the comments you had about needing more sharpening .. i think they''re only judging by dpc standards .. in the real world this would rank up there as something very special .. i think its excellent .. very real & very dramatic in its way ... hope you''re travelling well .. :):)x', '2007-09-22 07:47:17.000000', NULL, 0),
