(4152099, 579010, 67145, '<td valign="top">WOW .. ANOTHER brilliant photograph and impressive edit .. you have a wonderful creative approach and i love your dramatic results ... :)<br/>i''ve just read shawn''s comment and learnt another valuable lesson in dpc ... the bit where he says he brings back his original and compares it with the processing he''s done to see if he''s gone too far .. i go too far A LOT so i''ll be using that technique on my next edit .. i often go away from the computer and do something else and then come back, to get a fresh look, which often works too ... :)</td>', 'WOW .. ANOTHER brilliant photograph and impressive edit .. you have a wonderful creative approach and i love your dramatic results ... :)i''ve just read shawn''s comment and learnt another valuable lesson in dpc ... the bit where he says he brings back his original and compares it with the processing he''s done to see if he''s gone too far .. i go too far A LOT so i''ll be using that technique on my next edit .. i often go away from the computer and do something else and then come back, to get a fresh look, which often works too ... :)', '2007-10-08 16:26:29.000000', NULL, 0),
