(4165790, 579927, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh man!  Somehow I missed this after August''s Free Study.   This is spectacular!!!   You did such an expert job on processing this.  Not too much, but fully utilizing the tools that bring out its finest qualities.   Definitely wall hanging material.   And what a tribute to its amazing quality -- to win a 4th place honorable mention in an expert editing free study.   I''m in awe!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh man!  Somehow I missed this after August''s Free Study.   This is spectacular!!!   You did such an expert job on processing this.  Not too much, but fully utilizing the tools that bring out its finest qualities.   Definitely wall hanging material.   And what a tribute to its amazing quality -- to win a 4th place honorable mention in an expert editing free study.   I''m in awe! ', '2007-10-14 00:45:04.000000', NULL, 0),
