(4238043, 579659, 22537, '<td valign="top">Funny, I looked at this and identified this as similar to the work of the Group of Seven even before reading the description. Really quite outstanding, and with a few brush strokes, a dead ringer. As a photo, the only issue I''d have is the haloing on the ridge line and slight heavier use of color saturation that maybe needed.  Other than that, a vista worth revisiting and certainly an inspiration for a series of images. Nice job.</td>', 'Funny, I looked at this and identified this as similar to the work of the Group of Seven even before reading the description. Really quite outstanding, and with a few brush strokes, a dead ringer. As a photo, the only issue I''d have is the haloing on the ridge line and slight heavier use of color saturation that maybe needed.  Other than that, a vista worth revisiting and certainly an inspiration for a series of images. Nice job.', '2007-11-10 23:59:55.000000', NULL, 0),
