(4407001, 577937, 1717, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous!  i love the editing.  the dodging and burning are really masterfully done.  one suggestion...sometimes when heavy editing/sharpening is done, it can leave artifacts or hard edges on faces, eyes, noses, lips.  a very (VERY) small blur brush set to "darken" can clean up hard edges and "jaggies" like around his little nostrils and the creases at his eyes without causing a noticeable blur. all in all, though, i think this is a wonderful photo and it really should have placed higher.</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous!  i love the editing.  the dodging and burning are really masterfully done.  one suggestion...sometimes when heavy editing/sharpening is done, it can leave artifacts or hard edges on faces, eyes, noses, lips.  a very (VERY) small blur brush set to "darken" can clean up hard edges and "jaggies" like around his little nostrils and the creases at his eyes without causing a noticeable blur. all in all, though, i think this is a wonderful photo and it really should have placed higher.', '2008-01-20 16:54:09.000000', NULL, 0),
