(4489657, 576406, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh!!!  Zxaar!!!!   What an aMAZING fine art photo!   Thank you for sharing so eloquently the story behind it.  It makes it even more magical.   I actually think this time, I prefer the color version over the black and white.   It seems somehow to tell a little more of the story.  The lighting and shadows are exquisite.<br/> <br/>You are a painter. . ..I can see this as a huge painting.   How beautifully it would enhance a room!<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a most unique and beautiful capture.</td>', 'Oh!!!  Zxaar!!!!   What an aMAZING fine art photo!   Thank you for sharing so eloquently the story behind it.  It makes it even more magical.   I actually think this time, I prefer the color version over the black and white.   It seems somehow to tell a little more of the story.  The lighting and shadows are exquisite. You are a painter. . ..I can see this as a huge painting.   How beautifully it would enhance a room! Congratulations on a most unique and beautiful capture.', '2008-02-15 21:17:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4490234, 576406, 47483, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh!!!  Zxaar!!!!   What an aMAZING fine art photo!   Thank you for sharing so eloquently the story behind it.  It makes it even more magical.   I actually think this time, I prefer the color version over the black and white.   It seems somehow to tell a little more of the story.  The lighting and shadows are exquisite.<br/> <br/>You are a painter. . ..I can see this as a huge painting.   How beautifully it would enhance a room!<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a most unique and beautiful capture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You can see I am very attached to this one. <br/> <br/>About its being painting, yes. My wife always telling me that I keep on making portraits for people but have not done any of my daughter. I am going to start painting again, hopefully as soon as we shift into new house where I will have a dedicated room for myself. So that I could put colors around without having to worry about someone treading on them. <br/>I remember a photo of a baby in your portfolio, that one photo is always in my mind. I can not seem to get it out of my head. <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Oh!!!  Zxaar!!!!   What an aMAZING fine art photo!   Thank you for sharing so eloquently the story behind it.  It makes it even more magical.   I actually think this time, I prefer the color version over the black and white.   It seems somehow to tell a little more of the story.  The lighting and shadows are exquisite. You are a painter. . ..I can see this as a huge painting.   How beautifully it would enhance a room! Congratulations on a most unique and beautiful capture.   You can see I am very attached to this one.  About its being painting, yes. My wife always telling me that I keep on making portraits for people but have not done any of my daughter. I am going to start painting again, hopefully as soon as we shift into new house where I will have a dedicated room for myself. So that I could put colors around without having to worry about someone treading on them. I remember a photo of a baby in your portfolio, that one photo is always in my mind. I can not seem to get it out of my head. ', '2008-02-16 07:22:10.000000', NULL, 0),
