(5023843, 568544, 67145, '<td valign="top">lol .. you''re very into that crazy hat and the umbrella .. BRILLIANT shot .. and congrats on an excellent score in the free study .. its such a wonderful image .. at first i was thinking you did it in an advanced edit and was wondering how on earth .. lol .. then i noticed expert .. however you''ve achieved this its totally brilliant .. very magritte-ish .. i love stuff that is like life but with a weird and unexpected twist .. the time spent on this was well worth it .. and to achieve a work of art in 5 1/2 hrs is quick !! .. :)</td>', 'lol .. you''re very into that crazy hat and the umbrella .. BRILLIANT shot .. and congrats on an excellent score in the free study .. its such a wonderful image .. at first i was thinking you did it in an advanced edit and was wondering how on earth .. lol .. then i noticed expert .. however you''ve achieved this its totally brilliant .. very magritte-ish .. i love stuff that is like life but with a weird and unexpected twist .. the time spent on this was well worth it .. and to achieve a work of art in 5 1/2 hrs is quick !! .. :)', '2008-10-24 18:54:04.000000', NULL, 0),
